Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:00.00,RURU,,0,0,0,,（00:02:48）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.50,0:03:11.53,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,空露露——
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.09,0:03:15.65,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大家空露露——
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.89,0:03:17.90,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,空露露～
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.94,0:03:19.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,听得见吗～
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.26,0:03:23.44,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,能听见吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.90,0:03:26.90,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嘿咻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.03,0:03:34.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大家，再次空露露～
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.54,0:03:38.20,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我的声音，能好好听见吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.26,0:03:39.48,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「跟平时不一样」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.56,0:03:40.63,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没错哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.93,0:03:42.63,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,今天难得地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.74,0:03:44.35,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,用虹3D
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.91,0:03:47.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,想用下3D……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.90,0:03:51.65,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是这么打算的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.20,0:03:56.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么样，摄像头有捕捉到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.48,0:03:58.98,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「还挺能动」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.03,0:04:01.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,对，其实没怎么……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.55,0:04:05.47,RURU,,0,0,0,,就用了一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.64,0:04:09.56,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,复归后也就一次吧，大概
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.12,0:04:13.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有一次摄像头……普通的2D的摄像头
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.96,0:04:15.80,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,坏掉的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:18.63,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,用过一次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.36,0:04:20.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,所以真是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.49,0:04:22.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好久不见了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.95,0:04:24.06,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「不用发推文吗」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.10,0:04:25.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,阿勒？！没发
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.59,0:04:26.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没发呀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.94,0:04:28.35,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.11,0:04:31.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,稍等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.00,0:04:35.34,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,对的对的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.53,0:04:37.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还没发帖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.60,0:04:41.12,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，是法环那时候吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.02,0:04:43.60,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,直播中的时候……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.52,0:04:46.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,一次是用虹3D
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.89,0:04:47.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,来播
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.71,0:04:51.80,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,所以我觉得这大概是第二次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.68,0:04:55.90,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,失礼失礼，推文那边
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.96,0:04:57.13,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不小心……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.15,0:04:59.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不小心就彻底不小心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.18,0:05:01.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,稍等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.10,0:05:03.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,让我唰得一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.51,0:05:06.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,马上发推
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.10,0:05:13.66,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,请稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.63,0:05:18.58,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嘿咻……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.89,0:05:32.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,运动……度假胜地……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.80,0:05:39.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,应该不能写「马上开始」了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.55,0:05:44.79,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,最新作
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.09,0:05:49.28,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,要玩哦——
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.34,0:05:52.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,在玩哦——现在就在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.81,0:05:55.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,现、现在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.19,0:05:58.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,现在就在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:03.13,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,帖子发出去了非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.27,0:06:10.39,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.55,0:06:13.77,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我打字的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.34,0:06:16.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,说不了话呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.01,0:06:21.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉会把正在打的帖子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.63,0:06:23.77,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,直接念出来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.53,0:06:26.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,稍等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.50,0:06:29.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,其实念出来也没什么不好的就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.23,0:06:32.65,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，没问题吧，嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.40,0:06:38.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,发好了～
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.19,0:06:40.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,非常抱歉让各位久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.13,0:06:41.57,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.77,0:06:44.98,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,彻底……我还以为发过了，其实没发
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:47.88,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「朗读铃原」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.95,0:06:50.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我好像输入文章的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.60,0:06:52.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,会以朗读的形式……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.81,0:06:55.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,「呃，你好，呃」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.37,0:06:58.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,「承蒙关照，辛苦了」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.52,0:07:00.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,「呃，什么什么什么的」这样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.93,0:07:02.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不小心念出声这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.90,0:07:04.42,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这个还算那个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.44,0:07:06.80,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,算是主播常见操作吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.46,0:07:10.13,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「我还在想怎么没推文呢」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.15,0:07:12.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,失礼了——
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.85,0:07:17.49,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过，我在准备虹3D的摄像头什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.91,0:07:19.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,所以嘛，就那个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.30,0:07:21.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,也可能因此手忙脚乱了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.14,0:07:26.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,跟平时不太一样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.45,0:07:31.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,可能还稍微有点……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.59,0:07:34.44,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,相机什么的也还没怎么调好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.50,0:07:40.96,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那个，说不定前后左右动得太厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.98,0:07:46.29,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,会变的看着不太舒服，变得晕铃原也说不定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.44,0:07:48.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,请多包涵
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.82,0:07:51.70,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊对的对的，是3D哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.25,0:08:03.56,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,对的，我这晃来晃去的，有点晃来晃去的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.14,0:08:07.12,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,偶尔嘛，想着偶尔用一下3D也不错
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.04,0:08:13.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，那么各位，再次再次，久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.01,0:08:16.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,呃，今天让我们一起玩这个游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.00,0:08:20.78,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,《Nintendo Switch 运动 度假胜地》——
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.60,0:08:24.19,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,到运动之秋啦——
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.25,0:08:25.94,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大家都有在做运动吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.41,0:08:30.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过正好是刚出的最新作来着
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.94,0:08:38.23,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是10月22还是23号来着，我记得大概是这个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.09,0:08:43.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,所以真的也就是三四天前左右的感觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.50,0:08:47.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,最新运动…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.15,0:08:51.00,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「边做力量训练边看」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.76,0:08:54.20,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不错嘛，22号吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.28,0:08:57.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,22号刚发售的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.14,0:09:00.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,真的是真超最新作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.50,0:09:04.15,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是最新作啦——
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.63,0:09:07.15,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「电竞的话稍微」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.20,0:09:09.49,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,电竞吗，嘛那也算是运动
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.15,0:09:12.24,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「那就做做深蹲吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.30,0:09:13.94,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那我觉得还算挺累的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.98,0:09:18.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,要在我的直播时间内一直做深蹲可是相当的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.91,0:09:19.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,辛苦的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.71,0:09:22.06,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rChat}「我现在在健身房看」{\r}太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.88,0:09:25.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,时间有点晚了，回去路上小心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.43,0:09:29.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那么就开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.17,0:09:31.57,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「耐久开搞」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.21,0:09:37.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不会变成耐…不、不会…应…也不，应该不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.01,0:09:40.35,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,最近真的是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.44,0:09:42.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,工作一个接一个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:46.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这样那样的那个…早上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.28,0:09:48.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,必须要出门
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:52.78,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「在这座岛上，有挑战激烈比赛的对战运动」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.87,0:09:56.56,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「还有悠闲巡游名胜的休闲运动可以游玩」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.99,0:10:00.98,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不错嘛，有点像体能挑战，还是不一样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.60,0:10:06.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我那个，除了工作以外真的不出门，真是帮大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.66,0:10:09.94,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「运动之后能拿到点数」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.11,0:10:12.57,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「可以换衣服和饰品」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.74,0:10:14.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哦——还挺时尚
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.10,0:10:17.70,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,左边那孩子是不是有点像我？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.56,0:10:22.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,左边那孩子，像不像我？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.92,0:10:29.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,贝雷帽什么的，连徽章的位置都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.06,0:10:31.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是吧，很像……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.47,0:10:36.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,帽子好可爱呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.45,0:10:38.36,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶，这套
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.41,0:10:39.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,想要这套衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.66,0:10:42.00,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「气质挺像的」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.33,0:10:43.63,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就是眼睛颜色有点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.85,0:10:46.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,眼睛颜色、头发颜色要是改一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.37,0:10:48.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉真的会变得一模一样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.16,0:10:52.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，运动之后还能拿到点数
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.12,0:10:54.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,能换成衣服和饰品
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.56,0:10:57.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,换上喜欢的外观，多多运动吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.35,0:11:02.75,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「那么请选择想玩的运动」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.94,0:11:04.00,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,都有些什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.02,0:11:06.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,话说有几种来着
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.26,0:11:07.53,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,挺多的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.15,0:11:12.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,呃，12种
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.42,0:11:16.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,体感运动的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.08,0:11:17.23,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,看来是这样的……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.52,0:11:18.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,12……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.66,0:11:21.36,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,网球、保龄球
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.41,0:11:23.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,射箭、拳击
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.37,0:11:25.96,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拳击不错呢——
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.38,0:11:28.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我还挺喜欢拳击的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.35,0:11:32.13,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嗯？{\rChat}「声音有点破音了…？」{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.18,0:11:33.63,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哎呀，稍等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.67,0:11:37.41,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,各位等我重启一下好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.58,0:11:40.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就重启一下，马上…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.43,0:11:43.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就重连回来，请稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:54.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,看得到吗——
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.70,0:11:57.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,听得到吗——
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.58,0:12:03.14,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「欢迎回来——」「空露露」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.45,0:12:05.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,现在声音怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.09,0:12:06.77,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,变好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.94,0:12:09.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rChat}「欢迎回来」{\r}我回来啦——
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.14,0:12:12.05,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「听得见哦」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.08,0:12:15.06,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「听得见，而且没问题，看得见」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.28,0:12:17.17,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「欢迎回来——」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.24,0:12:18.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我回来了w
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.91,0:12:19.99,RURU,,0,0,0,,我回来了～
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.20,0:12:22.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,呃，虽说想就准备开始
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.83,0:12:25.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,对了，我还没确认音量平衡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.68,0:12:30.35,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,现在我的声音和游戏的声音，平衡都没问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.86,0:12:34.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有没有哪边太大或太小的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.99,0:12:38.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是不是把我的声音稍微调大一点比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.60,0:12:41.29,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,因为是运动游戏，离远了的话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.39,0:12:44.78,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我声音有可能会变小
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.26,0:12:46.26,RURU,,0,0,0,,话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.92,0:12:51.62,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,会不会撞到周围各种东西，有点担心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.40,0:12:55.40,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「好像没问题」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.43,0:12:57.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,要再调大点吗我的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.64,0:13:00.20,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.27,0:13:08.98,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这样如何
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.50,0:13:12.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,声音太大好像会爆音
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.93,0:13:15.28,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,现在怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.47,0:13:17.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大家——
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.64,0:13:20.66,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,空露露——
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.03,0:13:25.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嘛，我觉得应该没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.29,0:13:26.29,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.89,0:13:28.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,可能有点大哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.47,0:13:30.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,要是有点吵的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.78,0:13:33.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没有……破音吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.30,0:13:37.94,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没破音，那先边玩边调吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.86,0:13:41.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我先调大了一点哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.83,0:13:46.00,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「之后这边也能调」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.84,0:13:48.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rChat}「游戏声音有点小」{\r}OKOK
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.82,0:13:52.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,再微微调大一点游戏声音
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.85,0:13:56.39,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,话虽如此，不过先玩个什么试试看？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.65,0:14:01.95,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就在最开始那个网球那里看看情况吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.33,0:14:04.26,RURU,,0,0,0,,玩哪个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.34,0:14:05.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,姑且……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.13,0:14:07.81,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过这个，海上运动？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.21,0:14:11.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.51,0:14:16.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,休闲运动，水上摩托、滑板
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.88,0:14:18.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好厉害，还有拇指相扑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.05,0:14:21.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拇指相扑也是运动吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.66,0:14:26.60,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,说到拇指相扑，很久很久以前……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.76,0:14:31.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我真的刚出道的那时候，在怪物猎人里…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.48,0:14:35.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,把舞元桑的手指…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.69,0:14:39.41,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,折断了……好像有这么一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.47,0:14:43.06,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等下，那个不是拇指相扑来着，是掰手腕吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.67,0:14:46.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拇指相扑好像不太算运动吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.34,0:14:48.36,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.51,0:14:49.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是掰手腕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.80,0:14:53.12,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那种程度吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.24,0:15:03.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,先从网球开始边玩边确认下声音吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.60,0:15:05.40,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「在切片看过呢，那个」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.48,0:15:06.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.17,0:15:08.94,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那个也已经……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.11,0:15:14.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,都已经是六七年前，真的是很久以前……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.77,0:15:16.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,很久以前？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.09,0:15:17.59,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,的事了……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.16,0:15:19.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.80,0:15:24.12,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这个是该坐着……还是该站着玩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.09,0:15:28.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，这样能行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.24,0:15:36.87,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「比赛 慢速比赛  用慢慢移动的大尺寸球来玩」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.91,0:15:40.45,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「推荐给第一次玩的人，或者不擅长快节奏的人」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.52,0:15:43.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,暂时先玩慢速的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.66,0:15:47.90,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,顺便说我其实不太懂网球
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.98,0:15:51.00,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,只有《马力欧网球》程度的知识
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.84,0:15:58.66,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,确实，好像会撞到麦克风
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.23,0:16:06.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嘛，先试一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.13,0:16:11.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嗯……开始
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.16,0:16:17.72,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「欢迎！来决定你的外观和昵称吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.35,0:16:20.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,露露新手，新手露露
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.66,0:16:24.95,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,首先要捏角色，那个……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.71,0:16:27.94,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,虽然准备万全了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.55,0:16:31.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,现在不用太管这件事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.50,0:16:36.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,新手·露露～～
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.66,0:16:39.12,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,睫毛有
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.17,0:16:40.63,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,皱纹无
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.67,0:16:42.79,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,眼珠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.80,0:16:45.80,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,蓝色
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.99,0:16:50.12,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉像吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.07,0:16:53.10,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「捏角色，这下要搞到早上了」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.21,0:16:55.00,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没那么夸张吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.79,0:16:57.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大家都好可爱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.43,0:16:58.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哪个比较像……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.50,0:17:01.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这个？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.81,0:17:03.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.18,0:17:08.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大概这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.59,0:17:16.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rChat}「3D里也会瞪眼啊」{\r}瞪眼这说法…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.59,0:17:18.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.17,0:17:25.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大概这样吧，说像还挺像的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.27,0:17:30.38,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.25,0:17:33.06,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是内层挑染诶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.26,0:17:37.40,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我可没做内层挑染
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.43,0:17:44.23,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过在阴影部分，也不能说没有显暗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.28,0:17:45.79,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大概这种感觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.09,0:17:51.52,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.08,0:17:53.23,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,眉毛……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.85,0:17:58.46,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我的眉毛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.15,0:18:01.41,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是什么感觉来着
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.53,0:18:04.80,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,稍微有点下垂吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.08,0:18:11.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,下垂的？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.43,0:18:13.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,眉毛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.96,0:18:15.45,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「有贝雷帽吗」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.58,0:18:19.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大概那个……会有服装追加进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.06,0:18:23.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大概是下垂的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.16,0:18:25.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,微微的是这种感觉吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.31,0:18:29.28,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,稍稍有点下垂眼……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.06,0:18:35.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,要加腮红吗～～
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.98,0:18:36.98,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.63,0:18:39.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.95,0:18:43.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.54,0:18:46.29,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等下，不小心加上眼影了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.18,0:18:48.62,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,加上腮红
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.73,0:18:51.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嘛，虽说头发有点长
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.11,0:18:53.22,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,发尾还外翻
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.57,0:18:54.72,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,算了算了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.81,0:18:58.13,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这样OK……OK是哪个来着
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.37,0:19:02.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还挺可爱的，这个角色
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.61,0:19:04.29,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,衣服、饰品
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.38,0:19:06.70,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，可爱～粉色
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.03,0:19:12.38,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,粉色吧～就粉色吧～
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.21,0:19:16.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶？虽然帽子都很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.00,0:19:19.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过没有贝雷帽吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.57,0:19:22.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哇，眼镜也太可爱了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.71,0:19:23.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好适合
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.79,0:19:26.56,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,话说姿势也好可爱，什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.38,0:19:28.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这是什么姿势
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.23,0:19:34.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那个…像、像猫一样的姿势，不可爱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.01,0:19:38.86,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是哪个？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.90,0:19:39.90,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,幻之姿势？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.48,0:19:46.34,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我以为是猫呢，是那个啊…拉伸手臂的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.38,0:19:53.90,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就算有胡子也可爱……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.30,0:19:56.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,口罩
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.52,0:19:59.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有胡子也可爱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.47,0:20:02.79,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，OK
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.57,0:20:06.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,顺带一说……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.87,0:20:11.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,右边的时钟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.92,0:20:14.70,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,放到左边更好吗？算了，先……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.91,0:20:17.34,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,先这样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.39,0:20:19.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,换装结束……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.85,0:20:23.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,电脑的强度……先普通吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.10,0:20:24.62,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,一局会不会很短啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.69,0:20:25.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,总之先试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.20,0:20:29.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,音量平衡这些连带一起先看看情况吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.31,0:20:37.73,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「硬地球场，容易上手的基础球场」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.12,0:20:41.02,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「球弹得高，不容易掉速」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:45.42,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「对拉能持续很久的球场」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.56,0:20:48.35,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「球弹起后容易变慢」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.53,0:20:51.02,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「高手向的高难球场」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.06,0:20:54.35,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「球弹起来也会保持速度，容易低空飞行」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.44,0:20:55.64,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「系统选择」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.53,0:20:58.96,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,先选容易玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.10,0:21:00.81,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,从硬地球场开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.91,0:21:04.34,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,一看到写着「难」就会想会不会很难
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.58,0:21:06.78,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哪边……惯用手是右手
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.17,0:21:10.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.26,0:21:12.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OK～
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.92,0:21:14.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,先试试看咯！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.31,0:21:18.71,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「不要离电视太近」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.77,0:21:19.77,RURU,,0,0,0,,可以哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.08,0:21:27.80,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，等一下哦，为了不弄坏麦克风稍微离远一点哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.69,0:21:30.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.29,0:21:31.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,球也太大！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.03,0:21:34.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,预备——
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.04,0:21:39.06,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,一二……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.77,0:21:42.28,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,移动是这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.43,0:21:48.94,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rGame}「时机太晚」{\r}？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.03,0:21:50.49,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.67,0:21:52.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,刚才的太晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.49,0:21:59.52,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,话说好大啊，跟我认识的网球可能不太一样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.50,0:22:01.50,RURU,,0,0,0,,好，上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.64,0:22:06.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,难道说应该是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.55,0:22:08.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.30,0:22:18.41,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,想更这样往左往右的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.53,0:22:22.66,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,想感觉不错地打向角落
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.82,0:22:27.33,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶？不能更打过去一点吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.18,0:22:32.58,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「排球的球？」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.29,0:22:37.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,确实，与其说像是网球
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.57,0:22:39.15,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不如说更像排球的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.29,0:22:41.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，一球～
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.76,0:22:56.70,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.79,0:22:58.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哦？刚才那下不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.50,0:23:01.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉不错不错
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.45,0:23:05.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,确实动作也有点排球的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.08,0:23:07.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,预备——
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.20,0:23:10.57,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不错诶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.81,0:23:17.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,看球
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.98,0:23:22.77,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，打得还不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.42,0:23:25.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,试着打了个变化球
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.78,0:23:27.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不错呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.73,0:23:30.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，不过意外地能动起来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.45,0:23:34.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉不错，感觉不错
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.13,0:23:35.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,什么啊那个动作
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.25,0:23:38.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就是做个假动作
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.29,0:23:40.65,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,在极限时机挥拍的话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.22,0:23:42.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就会变成那样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.49,0:23:48.81,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,一……二
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.81,0:23:50.62,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就是这个就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.64,0:23:52.34,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，不过有点微妙
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.45,0:23:57.67,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是不是不该在隔音室里做这个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.27,0:24:00.86,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哎，好像跑到个微妙的位置了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.47,0:24:02.63,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是不是太往前了？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.80,0:24:03.80,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.32,0:24:06.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不开空调的话
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.90,0:24:09.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉要起火了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.15,0:24:11.15,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.55,0:24:16.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，开了开了开了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.07,0:24:18.00,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,预备——
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.89,0:24:25.12,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,话说这个……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.87,0:24:30.23,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,会突然
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.70,0:24:32.53,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,闪一下橙色的光
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.68,0:24:37.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哈诶～？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.39,0:24:38.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,奇怪的软绵绵球
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.01,0:24:42.22,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，不过意外地，不如说更中下怀了？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.55,0:24:46.17,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「听说会变凉快呢」
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.19,0:24:48.67,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过今天就挺凉快的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.87,0:24:51.13,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,虽说也有下雨的原因吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.31,0:24:53.63,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好～赢了——
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.10,0:24:55.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,赢了——
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.74,0:24:58.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,赢啦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.74,0:25:00.33,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉不错感觉不错
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.67,0:25:06.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OK，大概明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.70,0:25:09.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,靠刚才的一局
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.68,0:25:13.63,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,游戏的声音还有我的声音，听起来怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.73,0:25:16.45,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「甚至有点凉飕飕的」
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.55,0:25:19.78,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是啊，不过隔音室里特别……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.87,0:25:21.29,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,容易变热
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.49,0:25:24.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,其实意外的热哦，即便外面很冷
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.93,0:25:29.59,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「游戏声音正正好」
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.28,0:25:33.52,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「看着没问题」
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.10,0:25:41.24,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「露露酱还是拍全身比较好」
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.62,0:25:43.62,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拍全身？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.91,0:25:49.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,但是隔音室没那么大嘛……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.44,0:25:53.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,慌慌张张的样子会被拍进去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.12,0:25:57.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,声音能好好听到吗，没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.29,0:26:00.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,倒也不至于拍不到
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.52,0:26:03.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,但可能微妙的有点难操作
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.75,0:26:07.44,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,可能有点窄
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.37,0:26:11.79,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,虽然也不是不行，但大概……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.89,0:26:14.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等、等一下哦，我先试一下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.03,0:26:16.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,请、请稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.49,0:26:34.49,RURU,,0,0,0,,（跳00:26:35）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.39,0:26:44.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么说呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.67,0:26:49.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉拍的像在挑衅一样ww
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.07,0:26:59.15,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等等w
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.23,0:27:03.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感、感觉在俯视一样
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.07,0:27:07.63,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.76,0:27:10.15,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还是算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.82,0:27:13.70,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等、等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.74,0:27:18.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,请、请稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.00,0:27:31.00,RURU,,0,0,0,,（跳00:27:33）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.15,0:27:40.12,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rChat}「盛气凌人的姿势」{\r}是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.50,0:27:43.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好……OKOKOK
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.05,0:27:45.33,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.16,0:27:49.60,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rChat}「我们是被埋起来了吧」{\r}是哦ww
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.99,0:27:52.58,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,相当挑衅的……
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.01,0:27:54.34,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,为什么会
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.05,0:27:58.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,一拉摄像头就有点变得朝上拍了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.90,0:28:01.81,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.44,0:28:04.79,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OKOK
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.86,0:28:08.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那回到运动选择
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.17,0:28:16.51,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「有装好腕带吗？」
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.66,0:28:19.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,其实根本没装腕带
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.45,0:28:21.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,应该没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.25,0:28:22.79,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我是这么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.22,0:28:26.19,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,保龄球，保龄球
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.34,0:28:29.52,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,咦，我在《世界游戏大全51》里玩过这个嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.61,0:28:33.58,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有被说过挥得太用力了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.33,0:28:36.83,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「球瓶加到100瓶」
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.86,0:28:39.38,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「全中满分是3000分」
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.24,0:28:40.97,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「比赛」
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.99,0:28:45.55,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「投球把球瓶尽量多打倒，目标高分」
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.92,0:28:49.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哪个更那个，更常见来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.03,0:28:52.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,「令人怀念的100瓶」
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.84,0:28:55.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,咦，我玩过100瓶吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.41,0:28:59.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,3000分……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.10,0:29:01.64,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「挥的太用力了！」
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.35,0:29:07.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rChat}「比赛那边」「上面」{\r}上面那个比较常见……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.74,0:29:09.28,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.27,0:29:15.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,用同一个用户玩
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.71,0:29:17.12,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,标准还是特别模式？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.22,0:29:19.63,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,咦，还有障碍物之类的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.69,0:29:22.12,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,总之先标准，试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.28,0:29:24.40,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,右手
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.97,0:29:29.35,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,右手在发光呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.93,0:29:30.77,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.87,0:29:32.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,上了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.28,0:29:39.80,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「注意留出足够空间，别撞到周围的人或东西」
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.92,0:29:44.80,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就是得注意别搞破坏呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.96,0:29:49.10,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「请按ZR」
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.19,0:29:50.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，按了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.29,0:29:53.78,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「把正面朝向自己」
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.86,0:29:56.66,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.84,0:30:00.91,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「保持按住」
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.63,0:30:04.22,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「做投球动作吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.74,0:30:06.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.07,0:30:14.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,再来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.36,0:30:16.29,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「在胸前摆好姿势」
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.19,0:30:20.01,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「做投球动作吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.78,0:30:22.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，还行嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.11,0:30:24.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嘛第一局嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.27,0:30:28.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好好的命中了，可以可以
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.24,0:30:29.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OKOKOK
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.30,0:30:31.40,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,意外地还不错？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.99,0:30:36.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,第一局先随便玩玩嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.32,0:30:40.46,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,但是全中全中……这不是全中吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.65,0:30:45.65,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.82,0:30:48.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,咦？意外地打得还行？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.96,0:30:50.38,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,9瓶～
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.45,0:30:54.58,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,Ten瓶？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.15,0:31:01.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.17,0:31:03.59,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊……再往右一点吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.31,0:31:08.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,再往右一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.45,0:31:13.67,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这边，再稍微……
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.72,0:31:15.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不对，现在到不需要……
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.89,0:31:18.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.98,0:31:21.13,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，漂亮漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.96,0:31:23.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,全中——！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.15,0:31:25.52,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「比之前打得好了」
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.54,0:31:28.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我能好好控制力度了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.66,0:31:32.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂亮，全中——
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.32,0:31:34.49,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,Nice——好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.01,0:31:37.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,意外地我说不定有
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.16,0:31:40.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,保龄球的才能
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.83,0:31:43.10,RURU,,0,0,0,,不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.71,0:31:46.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不是挺好的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.84,0:31:51.63,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,在战斗中确实在成长了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.41,0:31:54.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,两连全中了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.75,0:31:57.95,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,咦，我好像有点厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.92,0:31:59.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,预备——
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.83,0:32:02.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.73,0:32:10.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,全中，好像抓到诀窍了……
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.03,0:32:15.77,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我完全抓到诀窍了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.83,0:32:16.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好像有点慢？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.91,0:32:18.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这球怎么变慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.64,0:32:20.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,意外地……
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.05,0:32:26.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.72,0:32:27.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,稍微变快了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.52,0:32:28.72,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,Fourth是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.34,0:32:30.65,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,Fourth的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.06,0:32:34.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,全中Fourth是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.73,0:32:38.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，就是连续四次全中的意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.19,0:32:42.39,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rChat}「职业选手啊」{\r}也没那么～
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.74,0:32:43.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.21,0:32:45.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,身为阳角
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.09,0:32:50.34,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,保龄球这种总得会一点
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.02,0:32:53.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不然阳角的名号可就挂不住了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.01,0:33:00.60,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,对精通此道的铃原来说，这点小事小菜一碟
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.80,0:33:07.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊～剩了一瓶呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.47,0:33:09.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,10瓶里的9瓶呢～
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.55,0:33:13.14,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「说这话不觉得悲伤吗」
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.70,0:33:15.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,也没觉得悲伤呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.95,0:33:18.12,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「有人一起玩吗」
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.17,0:33:19.17,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有有
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.78,0:33:21.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有的有的有的有的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.00,0:33:24.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,只要拜托的话，应该会有人陪我玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.03,0:33:26.98,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,只是还没拜托而已
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.74,0:33:33.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等一下，边角果然意外地难呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.94,0:33:39.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂亮——
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.09,0:33:41.13,RURU,,0,0,0,,漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.80,0:33:46.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.17,0:33:50.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,话说这不觉得很漂亮吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.40,0:33:53.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这个，那个，脚步……
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.38,0:33:55.52,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,像跳舞一样呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.78,0:33:56.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,预备——
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.29,0:34:05.41,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,8瓶吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.51,0:34:06.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,微妙地……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.89,0:34:09.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,话说这种时候能瞄准吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.17,0:34:14.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,瓶子左右分开的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.10,0:34:18.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,第二球还有可能全中吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.14,0:34:21.90,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,总会剩一个嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.24,0:34:25.44,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,反过来，球老往左拐的话，就往这边扔
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.46,0:34:27.46,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.84,0:34:29.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，不错
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.13,0:34:32.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,只能靠撞飞的瓶子再撞到另一个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.89,0:34:38.00,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,刚才要是稍微往前飞一点就撞上了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.90,0:34:40.52,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,果然还是挺难的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.91,0:34:42.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,只能靠把瓶打飞
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.73,0:34:45.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶？这还是靠技术能解决的问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.68,0:34:47.67,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，最后一球
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.37,0:34:51.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,预备——
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.33,0:34:55.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,咕…！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.44,0:35:00.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,剩七个瓶啊，等等，再来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.52,0:35:03.69,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「做得到的人就是做得到」
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.76,0:35:04.79,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,真厉害啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.04,0:35:06.22,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,预备——
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.71,0:35:07.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，刚才……
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.36,0:35:10.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,刚才
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.40,0:35:11.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,稍微
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.31,0:35:15.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,手指撞到椅子角了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.67,0:35:19.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.06,0:35:23.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,新纪录180大概什么水平？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.37,0:35:25.44,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,顺便一问
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.05,0:35:28.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,顺便一问
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.12,0:35:29.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rChat}「很痛的那种…」{\r}啊，完全没，那个……
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.96,0:35:31.67,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,并没有那么痛
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.08,0:35:32.89,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「椅子没事吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.91,0:35:34.60,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,别担心椅子
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.01,0:35:36.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,椅子的话……嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.57,0:35:37.78,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没事没事
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.20,0:35:39.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过有点那个
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.82,0:35:42.82,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「算高的」
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.22,0:35:45.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.28,0:35:49.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,180算好的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.17,0:35:50.24,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「相当厉害」
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.38,0:35:52.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,耶——
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.20,0:35:54.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,做到力——
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.13,0:35:57.19,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,180哦——
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.42,0:36:02.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,厉害唷
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.37,0:36:04.55,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「椅子太结实了」
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.57,0:36:05.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.87,0:36:07.57,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,椅子嘛……还挺……
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.93,0:36:09.17,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,结实的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.30,0:36:10.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,毕竟是电竞椅
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.06,0:36:15.06,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OKOK
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.93,0:36:22.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过我搞明白了，障碍物有点在意
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.17,0:36:25.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这是什么，保龄球彩绘是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.68,0:36:27.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还有这种东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.95,0:36:29.10,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「再玩一次」
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.14,0:36:30.33,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,改设…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.16,0:36:32.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,…置，等等等等
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.55,0:36:36.20,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那个障碍物什么的东西有点在意啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.85,0:36:40.59,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「现实中没打到过，180什么的」
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.96,0:36:41.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,现实……
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.53,0:36:44.14,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「首个挑战达成，恭喜您」
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.18,0:36:47.01,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「瞄准每个挑战的特殊条件来玩的话」
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.14,0:36:49.52,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「说不定能得到不同的体验」
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.07,0:36:51.70,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「挑战列表在这里」
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.66,0:36:56.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,网球
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.23,0:36:59.42,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「完成20次对拉」
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.45,0:37:00.87,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「火箭发球手」
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.97,0:37:02.28,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「截击达人」
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.47,0:37:06.51,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「扣杀达人」「直球取胜」「一分未失」
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.21,0:37:08.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,保龄球……啊，不过
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.89,0:37:10.98,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rGame}「火鸡达成」{\r}火鸡是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.32,0:37:15.62,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rGame}「全中连续3次」{\r}……
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.52,0:37:18.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我连续4次了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.77,0:37:20.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,果然意外的厉害吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.89,0:37:24.47,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「分瓶Get」
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.53,0:37:26.50,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「布局变成分瓶后补中」
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.57,0:37:28.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,分瓶是…？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.57,0:37:29.57,AN,,0,0,0,,※分瓶：剩余瓶的间距较大\N需要相当的技巧才能补中
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.80,0:37:31.66,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,火鸡就是那个嘛，好吃的肉
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.80,0:37:31.66,RURU,,0,0,0,,{\pos(660, 940)\fs48}Turkey
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.75,0:37:34.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,火鸡挺好吃的呢，圣诞节吃的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.75,0:37:34.75,RURU,,0,0,0,,{\pos(580, 940)\fs48}七面鳥
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.75,0:37:34.75,AN,,0,0,0,,※七面鳥=火鸡：头部与颈部没有羽毛的地方\N会因为情绪变化或求偶等因素呈现不同颜色\N因此得名七种面孔的鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.59,0:37:38.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不知不觉就快到了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.22,0:37:40.41,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还挺吓人的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.50,0:37:45.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不想意识到已经到10月后半了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.53,0:37:48.22,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「弧线球达人」
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.33,0:37:50.93,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「投出大幅弯曲的球拿下全中」
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.02,0:37:52.60,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「达成200分」
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.65,0:37:54.22,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「零失误游戏」
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.58,0:37:57.75,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「每一局都全中或补中」
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.89,0:37:59.65,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那种事可能吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.13,0:38:03.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这不就已经踏入职业的世界了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.20,0:38:10.43,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「别聊那种话题了」
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.60,0:38:14.12,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是啊，全人类最好都别聊那个
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.74,0:38:16.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我也还才
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.21,0:38:19.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,刚刚复归一个月
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.59,0:38:22.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,左右的感觉嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.29,0:38:24.29,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还早还早
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.36,0:38:28.57,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉才刚复归
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.91,0:38:30.74,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「100瓶比赛」
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.58,0:38:33.51,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「全部满分{\alpha&H80&}为3000分」
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.58,0:38:36.28,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶？这个我也很在意诶
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.37,0:38:38.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,100个球瓶会是什么样子的？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.81,0:38:40.35,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,要很大力吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.62,0:38:42.39,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.40,0:38:47.95,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OKOK
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.26,0:38:51.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哇，超级多啊ww
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.89,0:38:54.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哇，好想全打倒
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.65,0:38:56.65,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,来喽
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.01,0:39:00.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这球如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.36,0:39:03.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊不过感觉，瓶还挺轻呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.97,0:39:05.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,轻的轻的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.69,0:39:07.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,79瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.29,0:39:10.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，100瓶模式好像还挺爽的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.57,0:39:12.35,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.66,0:39:14.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,预备——
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.80,0:39:17.80,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,看球
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.53,0:39:24.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,中间的红瓶……没打到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.12,0:39:27.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过98也还算可以…？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.58,0:39:28.58,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不、不好说
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.82,0:39:29.44,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,多少……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.52,0:39:30.62,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不，得全倒才行
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.30,0:39:35.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,全部，完美获胜吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.21,0:39:36.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没能赢啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.12,0:39:39.95,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,81个瓶……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.98,0:39:43.22,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,左右分开的话嘛，还真有点不好搞呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.11,0:39:46.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那个、嗯不过，跟刚才一样……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.61,0:39:52.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,唔——微妙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.91,0:39:55.29,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,微妙得恰到好处……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.10,0:39:59.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.61,0:40:05.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这下如何
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.03,0:40:10.19,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,至少右边倒了，至少……
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.24,0:40:13.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,左边还剩几瓶？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.99,0:40:15.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，上了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.43,0:40:19.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,上啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.21,0:40:20.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,呃有点弯过头了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.36,0:40:24.42,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么打都会剩下中间两瓶……
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.45,0:40:26.95,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,想要一次100瓶的全中
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.63,0:40:28.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.53,0:40:30.53,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,再稍微往这边一点…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.59,0:40:31.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.43,0:40:32.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,应该是这
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.30,0:40:35.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这回呢
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.53,0:40:42.39,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.07,0:40:46.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,左边那瓶要是能倒的话，本来能直着过去的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.20,0:40:50.52,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那就从这边朝左边……
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.43,0:40:54.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拐弯
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.83,0:40:56.19,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,也是做不到的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.33,0:40:58.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哇——可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.81,0:41:01.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,像我头上长出瓶子来了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.48,0:41:04.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，上了……
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.80,0:41:05.86,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,预备——
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.90,0:41:10.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哦？诶？成了ww
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.51,0:41:15.00,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这感觉……相当爽哦
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.11,0:41:16.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,很爽很爽
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.79,0:41:19.70,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,为什么那么爽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.86,0:41:28.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊嗯……本来觉得手感挺好来着
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.16,0:41:31.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过球都聚在右边
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.07,0:41:34.96,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,所以稍微从这边往左——
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.49,0:41:36.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不是左，是右
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.69,0:41:39.97,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，何渣操
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.65,0:41:42.53,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,渣操了啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.95,0:41:45.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，再来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.34,0:41:47.34,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,预备——
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.71,0:41:50.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,看球
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.94,0:41:53.52,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哦？漂亮……漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.63,0:41:54.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂上加亮
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.45,0:41:58.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,铃原君真菜——
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.09,0:42:01.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过适应了，打得越来越好了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.50,0:42:03.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还打出两次全中呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.72,0:42:05.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊等等撞到…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.16,0:42:08.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,预备——
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.91,0:42:12.97,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，稍微往左偏了……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.00,0:42:14.70,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过这个布局……可以补中？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.49,0:42:17.19,RURU,,0,0,0,,正中直球
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.26,0:42:20.23,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,正中直球，嘿咻……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.95,0:42:25.44,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,咕——……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.36,0:42:30.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,剩了一瓶……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.26,0:42:35.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,上……！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.52,0:42:38.70,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,左边吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.94,0:42:44.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,左边漂亮的留下了一排瓶呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.51,0:42:47.62,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不，还能从这附近……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.32,0:42:49.62,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,朝左！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.04,0:42:55.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,真难斜着打啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.50,0:42:59.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好吧好吧，最后一球…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.61,0:43:00.96,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,预备——
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.50,0:43:05.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,中了！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.05,0:43:08.95,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,成功啦——！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.98,0:43:11.60,RURU,,0,0,0,,做到力
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.44,0:43:16.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊等，还能…干得不错？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.12,0:43:17.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，难道说
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.20,0:43:18.67,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,再玩一次咚
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.13,0:43:20.81,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还能再玩一次咚
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.13,0:43:23.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,上啊…！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.28,0:43:26.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哦？等下，我好像很能打
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.41,0:43:28.78,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,疑？我好像打保龄球很强
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.73,0:43:32.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,原来我很强啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.03,0:43:35.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶？现实中的话
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.18,0:43:38.17,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,真有100瓶的保龄球吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.58,0:43:43.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,咕——……
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.65,0:43:47.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,散开了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.25,0:43:50.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有点得意忘形了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.26,0:43:54.86,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,Finish～
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.26,0:43:58.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶，有吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.33,0:44:00.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,100瓶，100瓶保龄球…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.47,0:44:03.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,咦，平时的保龄球是…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.91,0:44:09.40,RURU,,0,0,0,,{\pos(825, 1020)\fs48}k
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.91,0:44:09.40,RURU,,0,0,0,,{\pos(920, 1020)\fs48}k=1
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.91,0:44:09.40,RURU,,0,0,0,,{\pos(910, 980)\fs48}16
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.91,0:44:09.37,RURU,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1065, 1020)\fs48}k
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.91,0:44:09.40,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,(a   )        , a    = k
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.53,0:44:11.12,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大概16瓶？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.17,0:44:13.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,刚才总觉得…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.96,0:44:16.15,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「不是，挺厉害的」
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.22,0:44:17.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哦……！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.72,0:44:21.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,1326分
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.05,0:44:24.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，一般是10瓶啊w
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.01,0:44:29.96,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我数多了，不是16瓶是10瓶呢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.74,0:44:32.40,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶？{\rChat}「为什么是单人玩w」{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.02,0:44:34.44,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,你们看上去是单人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.70,0:44:39.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大家原来看不到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.44,0:44:40.79,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,在我后面…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.48,0:44:42.72,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好多人哦
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.13,0:44:46.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,明明是差不多10人的联动，看不到呀
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.92,0:44:50.29,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,在你们看来是单人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.83,0:44:51.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嘿——
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.81,0:44:58.63,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「幻想朋友。。。」
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.64,0:45:05.57,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,呃
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.59,0:45:08.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那个障碍物什么的我有点在意啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.27,0:45:11.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不对，弄错了弄错了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.08,0:45:14.23,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等等等等，回去…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.20,0:45:19.41,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,投掷前的正确位置
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.46,0:45:23.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过实际超难的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.57,0:45:27.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,在我小时候保龄球……好像……
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.79,0:45:34.44,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,在我爸公司有保龄球大赛什么的活动
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.68,0:45:39.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,然后因为小朋友们也都能参加
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.55,0:45:43.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,所以我小时候参加过一次，那时候
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.42,0:45:49.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有个倒数第一名往上数第二名的奖什么的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.76,0:45:50.81,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,叫Booby奖来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.76,0:45:52.76,AN,,0,0,0,,※Booby奖：在英语俚语中Booby本义是笨蛋/最后一名\N在日本却因为为最后一名提供丰厚的奖励作为鼓励，\N出现很多故意争最后一名的情况\N最终变成奖励更难控分的倒数第二名的奖项
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.83,0:45:52.34,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,叫什么来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.50,0:45:54.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,反正我拿到过哦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.30,0:45:59.81,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,叫Booby奖吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.78,0:46:03.46,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我也拿过…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.01,0:46:07.31,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「微妙的奖w」
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.94,0:46:13.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,毕竟还是小小的小不点原，就普通地很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.79,0:46:15.56,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,倒数第二
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.58,0:46:20.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我记得当时觉得排后面意外也有好事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.94,0:46:22.45,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「努力奖」
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.88,0:46:26.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.18,0:46:30.19,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「对小孩来说很难呢」
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.25,0:46:32.72,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不，本来你看，球…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.78,0:46:35.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,对吧，那个很重嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.60,0:46:38.65,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,射箭……
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.17,0:46:41.42,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,射箭！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.93,0:46:45.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等等，射箭我想试试啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.99,0:46:49.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不觉得很帅吗？射箭啊柔道啊什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.93,0:46:53.53,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,真的就只是很帅，剑道也是
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.31,0:46:55.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那个，真的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.42,0:46:59.28,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是抱着不正经的心态说的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.40,0:47:01.70,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,真的超绝帅气啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.35,0:47:04.48,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「靶子选谁啊？」
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.50,0:47:06.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么一个个都这么吓人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.28,0:47:10.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,才不会有人当靶子啦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.35,0:47:14.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,看那里不是有个像眼珠一样的东西嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.56,0:47:17.34,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，OK
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.63,0:47:18.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,标准
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.34,0:47:20.58,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,广场、沙滩
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.66,0:47:22.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这个有分顺手不顺手的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.50,0:47:26.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,总之先从基础的广场开始吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.93,0:47:27.65,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,右…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.70,0:47:29.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶，等等{\rGame}「用哪只手拉弓」{\r}……
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.43,0:47:33.44,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这是说用惯用手拉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.61,0:47:34.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,什、什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.93,0:47:36.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,用惯用手…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.01,0:47:39.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这样一捏，然后拉
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.73,0:47:45.06,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,一下擒住？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.65,0:47:49.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rChat}「基本都是惯用手哦」{\r}OKOK
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.29,0:47:52.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,呃……{\rGame}「用点赞握法握住Joy-Con」{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.86,0:47:55.35,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,点赞握法就叫点赞握法啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.12,0:47:57.94,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「请用点赞握法」
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.97,0:47:58.77,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.91,0:48:00.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.70,0:48:03.83,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「竖起大拇指」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.81,0:48:07.81,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「握住Joy-Con」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.51,0:48:11.52,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「不要用食指按按钮」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.54,0:48:14.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，那个，食指不按
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.40,0:48:16.57,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.44,0:48:19.15,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,原来这个叫点赞握法
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.28,0:48:21.29,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「用大拇指按按钮」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.52,0:48:25.56,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OK，点赞握法
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.71,0:48:27.53,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「请保持与电视的距离」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.59,0:48:29.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,请不要破坏显示器
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.05,0:48:31.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.78,0:48:33.58,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.55,0:48:39.41,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「射箭是瞄准靶子射出箭，以拿高分为目标的运动」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.54,0:48:45.93,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「按架好弓箭、拉箭射出的顺序，现在开始练习」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.06,0:48:47.96,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.47,0:48:52.44,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「首先朝屏幕方向举起」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.29,0:48:54.97,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「大拇指按下」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.35,0:48:57.94,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「先来练习架弓和箭」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.27,0:49:01.29,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「双手向前伸」
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.39,0:49:02.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.60,0:49:09.08,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「ZL和ZR两边都持续按住」
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.22,0:49:11.41,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OK～
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.36,0:49:15.86,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「接下来是拉箭射出的练习」
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.11,0:49:20.93,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「按出现的说明，从1到4按顺序试试吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.07,0:49:23.08,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「双手向前伸」
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.02,0:49:30.62,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「ZR、ZL保持按住，只把右手拉到胸前」
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.44,0:49:35.34,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「一边瞄准靶子」
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.79,0:49:38.58,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「将ZR」
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.72,0:49:41.80,GAMETEXT,,0,0,0,,「松开」
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.81,0:49:45.17,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哇——诶还挺好玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.19,0:49:47.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,配合瞄准射箭对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.98,0:49:49.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶，好玩好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.95,0:49:51.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,往前伸
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.49,0:49:52.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拉
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.05,0:49:56.34,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,朝着瞳孔一样的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.48,0:50:07.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,射出
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.72,0:50:09.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊——可惜……
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.20,0:50:14.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,想打正中间啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.31,0:50:17.40,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,毕竟那里最好吧，从得分来说
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.56,0:50:25.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等等，好像有点偏了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.30,0:50:34.96,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,意外地，可能很难瞄正中央
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.96,0:50:38.23,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「实际试试也不错啊」
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.25,0:50:40.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是啊，想玩想玩
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.98,0:50:42.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉很有活力很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.36,0:50:44.40,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「感觉会抖个不停」
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.42,0:50:49.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,实际拉弓也要花很大力气吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.81,0:51:01.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,别抖啊左手
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.29,0:51:08.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,为什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.27,0:51:11.23,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,总往左下偏一点为何？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.00,0:51:15.23,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哇好不甘心，好想射一次正中
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.71,0:51:17.72,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,预备——
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.47,0:51:28.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，不行，太菜了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.85,0:51:30.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,真是菜完了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.11,0:51:32.97,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是会往下掉一点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.49,0:51:35.63,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉还是稍微往上瞄比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.18,0:51:39.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,毕竟还有名为重力的东西，就是这么回事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.28,0:51:44.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,稍微往上一点……
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.47,0:51:47.97,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,天才
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.97,0:51:50.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.80,0:51:53.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好好地
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.14,0:51:57.95,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好好地，正中直球，瞄准射击
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.91,0:51:59.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.80,0:52:13.28,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂亮～
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.58,0:52:14.41,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.43,0:52:15.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂上加亮
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.32,0:52:17.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.72,0:52:22.36,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，这不是能打中中心嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.49,0:52:29.20,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不，真家伙也想试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.34,0:52:32.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哎呀？可能还挺厉害的？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.43,0:52:34.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,也许抓到诀窍了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.55,0:52:37.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,在战斗中成长着
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.30,0:52:40.56,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.92,0:52:52.23,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂亮啊漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.04,0:52:55.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这就是猎人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.21,0:52:57.54,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「可以自称狙击手了」
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.93,0:53:00.59,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么说呢，弓果然是好东西
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.28,0:53:04.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,枪什么的也不错啦，但就是弓独有的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.25,0:53:20.34,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好……
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.36,0:53:21.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OKOKOK
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.64,0:53:28.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉连着三次都直接正中了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.07,0:53:30.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.39,0:53:40.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好箭
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.49,0:53:44.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,厉害厉害，厉害厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.45,0:53:47.60,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,挺有天赋的？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.62,0:53:49.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过毕竟只是游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.43,0:53:53.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,要是真能这么爽就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.25,0:54:00.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,渣操了……
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.89,0:54:03.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过10分的话好歹，啊……不过
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.99,0:54:05.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还想再稍微
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.80,0:54:08.79,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,再往右一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.08,0:54:33.81,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,咕，好菜啊，太菜了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.52,0:54:36.53,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好像……
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.63,0:54:39.40,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,而且就刚才说了再往右…嗯？右？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.48,0:54:41.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,左、左、右
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.31,0:54:42.28,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,稍微
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.38,0:54:43.62,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,再来一点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.87,0:54:57.80,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.88,0:54:59.20,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.89,0:55:01.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,调整了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.09,0:55:04.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,虽然偏左右去了但又调回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.87,0:55:09.78,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等等，这是练习中？我一直在练习啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.62,0:55:19.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就单纯太好玩了嘛，就一直在练，我还以为……
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.48,0:55:21.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这是正式的了，原来是练习啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.82,0:55:24.15,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是练习啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.80,0:55:32.00,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，OK OK，练了这么多，正式来应该没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.02,0:55:34.77,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「打算练到极致吗这是w」
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.82,0:55:36.39,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我觉得已经到极致了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.92,0:55:38.93,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「玩法说明到此结束」
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.95,0:55:41.42,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「集中瞄准靶子，拿高分吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.77,0:55:42.65,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.09,0:55:48.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,新手·露露……
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.61,0:55:51.62,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.58,0:55:56.38,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「把Joy-Con对着屏幕举起来」
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.86,0:55:59.47,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「用拇指按下按钮」
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.90,0:56:02.90,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.96,0:56:06.60,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rGame}「把Joy-Con竖起来」{\r}竖起来了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.98,0:56:08.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这样……好
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.59,0:56:12.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,架弓
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.06,0:56:29.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,唔——不甘心——
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.61,0:56:33.34,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,离正中间还差一步往左啊，再一点
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.67,0:56:35.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好调整一下，调整……
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.63,0:56:36.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.91,0:56:37.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,预备——
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.93,0:56:54.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,再往上一点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.70,0:56:58.49,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.63,0:57:00.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我可能是那种一到正式就变弱的类型
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.74,0:57:02.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,调整一下，预备——
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.29,0:57:13.82,RURU,,0,0,0,,如…嗯……
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.14,0:57:17.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嗯，还行，10分说明好歹算正中判定
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.80,0:57:20.44,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「感觉练习时更好啊ww」
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.76,0:57:24.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嗯……练习时能更瞄到中间一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.59,0:57:26.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，再来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.47,0:57:29.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.35,0:57:31.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,刚才那个也是练习？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.27,0:57:39.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，OKOK，来吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.19,0:57:41.20,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,预备——
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.74,0:57:51.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，完美——
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.21,0:57:54.80,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我可能正式上场更强
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.02,0:57:59.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,预备——
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.53,0:58:06.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.50,0:58:08.00,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂上加亮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.47,0:58:13.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不，果然正式上场时能调整到位呢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.84,0:58:14.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.78,0:58:15.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,上了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.18,0:58:31.35,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,渣操了……
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.35,0:58:35.93,RURU,,0,0,0,,稍微偏右了点呢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.25,0:58:39.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,算了算了，再来再来……嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.29,0:58:43.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这是换位置了吗，这也不是……
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.97,0:58:45.57,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,又不是练习
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.76,0:58:48.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,上了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.82,0:58:51.95,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好像有点近
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.88,0:59:02.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶？不是吧，往下飘了为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.63,0:59:03.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,风？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.14,0:59:05.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,刚才刮风了？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.82,0:59:09.42,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「2米算远吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.51,0:59:10.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，这个算远啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.03,0:59:19.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.88,0:59:20.56,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.05,0:59:24.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,刚才好好的读懂风了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.97,0:59:27.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.28,0:59:29.19,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,预备——
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.99,0:59:44.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,偏了，咕……
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.72,0:59:49.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,糟了，射箭那一瞬间我就意识到偏了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.90,0:59:54.35,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rChat}「憋气了？」{\r}说不定是憋气了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.37,0:59:55.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,憋气成习惯了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.15,0:59:58.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶，那个，这个怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.42,1:00:00.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,85分算什么水平
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.25,1:00:05.81,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好像有点想再来一次，等等好像不对…那个对吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.15,1:00:11.09,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「可以玩特别规则了」
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.21,1:00:15.63,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「从分成四块的靶子里瞄准自己区域的特别规则」
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.96,1:00:16.96,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.31,1:00:20.73,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「三连命中、无失误达成」
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.06,1:00:22.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,无失误？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.49,1:00:27.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，姑且是这样，只要射中靶子就行了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.83,1:00:30.25,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「这不是挺高的吗」
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.35,1:00:34.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不，最近我可能对自己有点严格
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.34,1:00:38.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好像变得有点无法接受了……
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.50,1:00:45.40,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,对自己的要求还要更高更高这样
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.95,1:00:52.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rChat}「因为在跳舞？」{\r}啊可能是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.14,1:00:56.12,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,对对对，真的，像舞蹈课上也是
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.14,1:01:00.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就算被说完全没问题了，也会觉得哪里不对
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.14,1:01:02.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,更高、更强！变成这样
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.77,1:01:05.23,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉一辈子都是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.42,1:01:06.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那个……
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.66,1:01:09.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,射箭
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.61,1:01:15.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,特殊…这个吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.08,1:01:19.25,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「靶子分成四块的特别规则，瞄准自己的区域」
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.89,1:01:21.52,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我可能是很专注的那种人
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.19,1:01:24.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,想看得更高一点
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.55,1:01:28.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,广场……
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.65,1:01:31.98,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,去别的地方也不错，去沙滩那边看看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.98,1:01:34.58,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,对对，这么说回来的话
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.65,1:01:38.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,决斗大师也是总泡在排位里
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.06,1:01:44.17,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,一直默默默默得在练
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.91,1:01:49.59,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还想要变得更加更加强
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.61,1:01:51.12,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还能变得更强
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.50,1:01:53.39,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶？CPU是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.27,1:01:55.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.94,1:01:57.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这个是竞技的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.24,1:01:59.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等、等一下，我还没搞懂
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.51,1:02:03.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,分成四块的特别规则，瞄准自己的区域
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.48,1:02:10.36,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「上进心好强啊」
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.81,1:02:13.34,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「能玩这么久好强」
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.42,1:02:16.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过说回来，昨天玩太多了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.61,1:02:20.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,与其说昨天…今天…今天也要正常出勤
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.09,1:02:22.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,所以想着要确保睡觉时间
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.99,1:02:23.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.10,1:02:28.44,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,晚上睡前想着稍微
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.37,1:02:31.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,玩一下决斗大师…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.92,1:02:34.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,算了……
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.65,1:02:37.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,根本不是稍微玩玩就结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.02,1:02:40.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.78,1:02:48.96,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,别撞到东西
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.79,1:02:56.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,本来想着打上大师段位就结束的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.13,1:02:58.49,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,结果一直上不去……
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.98,1:03:03.32,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「闪烁的就是自己的区域」
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.55,1:03:05.87,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「射中就算自己的分」
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.19,1:03:10.69,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「射中没闪烁的区域会给别人加3分，所以得小心」
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.76,1:03:11.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.11,1:03:14.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,原来还需要反应神经啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.44,1:03:21.39,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶，亮的地方在哪在哪在哪在哪
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.49,1:03:22.49,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没风
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.69,1:03:25.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这个算亮着吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.29,1:03:31.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,露露、席尔克、桑德拉、露露……
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.15,1:03:33.15,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么有两个露露啊www
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.71,1:03:35.97,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那个露露是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.00,1:03:37.00,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶？谁啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.65,1:03:38.95,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.56,1:03:40.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我是露露吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.66,1:03:43.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,为什么会有两个露露啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.42,1:03:46.42,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,谁啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.88,1:03:48.15,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,谁啊，露露
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.01,1:03:50.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,二重身？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.79,1:03:52.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不认识的露露
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.70,1:03:54.06,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「谁啊那个露露？？」
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.55,1:03:58.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,闪着光的地方是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.71,1:04:10.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,说是失误呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.62,1:04:16.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我有点看不懂这个光，光是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.03,1:04:21.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不是瞄到正中间就行了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.10,1:04:25.20,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,18～这样就行吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.35,1:04:30.38,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉像是在哪见过这个露露
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.84,1:04:37.77,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,可能在哪见过也说不定
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.32,1:04:39.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我跟那个露露
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.99,1:04:44.58,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哎这露露是拿什么做的啊这个
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.62,1:04:47.20,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是人森吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.41,1:04:51.00,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这是我的Mii吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.49,1:04:57.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,看着像旧版本/新版本似的ww
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.66,1:05:01.13,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,人森吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.18,1:05:02.94,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,Mii的露露吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.31,1:05:04.60,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「就是Mii吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.62,1:05:05.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，是Mii啊……
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.27,1:05:09.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.69,1:05:14.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,竟然是过去的自己，那可不能输了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.25,1:05:17.06,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好……
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.25,1:05:24.44,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那为了绝对不输给这家伙，我……
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.18,1:05:38.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,糟了，我要变成冒牌货了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.17,1:05:48.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这箭怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.21,1:05:50.60,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,7…7分什么水平
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.49,1:05:52.91,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「双倍机会！」
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.99,1:06:01.60,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,别动，靶子
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.92,1:06:11.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嗯……还行还行……
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.21,1:06:13.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,算了算了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.50,1:06:16.38,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,过去
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.25,1:06:18.15,RURU,,0,0,0,,的自己
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.78,1:06:19.81,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,赢不
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.13,1:06:20.93,RURU,,0,0,0,,了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.84,1:06:23.19,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不，勉强还……
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.12,1:06:28.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我才是真正的，铃原……
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.57,1:06:32.70,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,意外地过去的自己挺强的，这家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.80,1:06:34.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,明明CPU只是普通难度……
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.73,1:06:52.67,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,7分，倒也不算差吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.47,1:07:10.95,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,因为会动……靶子，请你别动～
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.88,1:07:15.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好……再来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.66,1:07:16.78,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不想输……
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.67,1:07:51.17,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我是
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.76,1:07:52.96,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,伪原露露
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.92,1:07:58.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,一分
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.08,1:08:01.52,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就差一分
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.84,1:08:05.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不够啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.30,1:08:07.95,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,明明就差一分……
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.19,1:08:09.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,再来！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.53,1:08:11.46,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,过去
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.29,1:08:13.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我想超越它
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.28,1:08:16.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,赢过昨天的自己
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.63,1:08:18.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,再来
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.14,1:08:21.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.83,1:08:22.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这次一定
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.53,1:08:27.29,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,总之总之，诀窍我已经懂了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.60,1:08:28.60,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.38,1:08:30.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,预备——
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.76,1:08:43.53,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,噼啪，好～
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.23,1:08:49.34,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,对了，9是最高分没错吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.36,1:08:50.06,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,9分
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.64,1:09:04.28,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哦～好
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.07,1:09:06.96,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「10大概是最高的」
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.99,1:09:08.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,正中央是10吗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.13,1:09:09.13,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OKOKOK……
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.49,1:09:12.49,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,预备——
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.76,1:09:25.56,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶，胡扯
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.60,1:09:27.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,几乎是正中间嘛，几乎是……
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.09,1:09:30.56,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,糟了，我要输了吗……
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.81,1:09:32.97,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,咦，不在……
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.26,1:09:39.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,席尔克、阿莉莎、卢卡
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.51,1:09:41.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,卢卡？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.66,1:09:43.97,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,卢卡是谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.51,1:09:45.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还给我啊露露
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.03,1:09:47.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,露露
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.32,1:09:50.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,居然赢了就跑……
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.59,1:09:54.35,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,现在才发现人已经不在了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.65,1:09:57.58,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,竟然赢了就跑不可饶恕！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.76,1:09:59.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么会有这种事
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.05,1:10:01.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,卢卡是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.95,1:10:04.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,算了，别输给卢卡吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.40,1:10:10.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嘛，拿到第一就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.00,1:10:11.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好……
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.47,1:10:14.96,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,本来还想复仇的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.05,1:10:28.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,算了算了，9的话也还算不错
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.47,1:10:59.86,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,8分啊……姑且是瞄着正中间的啊……
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.38,1:11:01.19,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.13,1:11:14.94,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,唔嗯咕……9分
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.23,1:11:18.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,正中间原来这么难中
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.79,1:11:21.22,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,算了算了算了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.80,1:11:23.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过比刚才
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.30,1:11:25.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好点吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.35,1:11:27.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.41,1:11:29.34,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,上了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.48,1:11:47.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,MISS
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.01,1:11:52.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是会动的……
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.33,1:11:54.33,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,靶子
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.57,1:12:05.34,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,现在！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.05,1:12:07.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊……！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.70,1:12:09.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我不擅长纵向的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.17,1:12:13.80,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,纵向的意外地还挺难
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.28,1:12:24.06,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,比想象中偏上
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.91,1:12:27.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不对，说不定会输
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.75,1:12:32.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,赢了吗，姑且还是
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.42,1:12:35.17,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，不过超过了昨天的自己
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.24,1:12:36.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,说是82分
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.39,1:12:38.65,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,刚才的……
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.85,1:12:42.86,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,真正的露露，超过她了吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.21,1:12:50.39,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,刚才那位露露桑，不知所踪了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.98,1:12:54.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,赢了就跑的那个露露桑，本尊的露露桑
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.12,1:12:58.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还能在哪儿再见到吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.69,1:13:04.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过从分数上来说
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.07,1:13:08.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,比起刚才那位露露，我这边
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.90,1:13:12.33,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,分数还要更高
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.06,1:13:14.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,赢就是赢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.31,1:13:18.58,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那果然我
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.36,1:13:20.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,毫无疑问的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.65,1:13:22.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是真正的空露露
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.11,1:13:26.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rChat}「可以说欢迎回来了」{\r}我回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.99,1:13:29.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这样我就算是回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.64,1:13:37.34,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶，我在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.30,1:13:40.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,差点要无休无止得玩射箭了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.47,1:13:41.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没这回事
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.68,1:13:43.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶？啊，已经过了一小时了？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.16,1:13:45.65,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「已经连续游玩了一小时」
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.67,1:13:47.99,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「如果累了请别勉强，休息一下吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.09,1:13:50.47,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「要不要去『物品中心』休息一下？」
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.77,1:13:52.79,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,物品中心也确实有点在意
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.88,1:13:56.36,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过等等，我好像还只玩了保龄球和射箭ww
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.89,1:14:02.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还只玩了保龄球和射箭
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.12,1:14:05.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,12个项目里才玩了2个诶
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.00,1:14:08.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,稍微试试拳击吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.38,1:14:14.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，拳击是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.63,1:14:19.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.17,1:14:32.98,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嘛就先普通模式
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.42,1:14:37.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拇指，点赞握法
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.97,1:14:40.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.38,1:14:49.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,开始
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.46,1:14:51.56,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.89,1:14:57.90,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「快速把Joy-Con伸出去，朝脸上打一拳吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.21,1:15:00.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,呃
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.11,1:15:02.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是这样？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.81,1:15:10.15,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好OK——！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.87,1:15:15.65,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「接下来是瞄准身体击打的练习」
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.69,1:15:16.46,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,身体……
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.65,1:15:18.00,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,来了吗，身体击打
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.41,1:15:20.73,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「把Joy-Con朝斜下方」
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.50,1:15:24.52,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.08,1:15:27.53,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「再快一点」
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.18,1:15:32.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊是不是那个……
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.04,1:15:36.28,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不能自然地、像挖身体那样打吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.43,1:15:40.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,得普通地朝斜下方直直地打才行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.45,1:15:46.94,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,真往内脏那边施加冲击的打法，好像不能用呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.52,1:15:48.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.59,1:15:50.12,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「接下来是防御练习」
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.14,1:15:52.05,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「防住对方的拳头吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.51,1:15:54.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,呃
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.76,1:15:58.72,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「双手的Joy-Con朝斜下方，身体防御」
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.65,1:16:00.94,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,身体防御
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.60,1:16:03.19,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是像这样吧，OKOKOK
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.55,1:16:09.92,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「最后是让身体左右倾斜的练习」
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.16,1:16:18.66,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,能跟上我的斯必德吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.87,1:16:24.97,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「让身体和双手的Joy-Con一起倾斜吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.99,1:16:28.67,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「一起夹紧腋下倾斜是诀窍」
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.29,1:16:37.55,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「Joy-Con是不是没有竖起来呢？」
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.57,1:16:39.57,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，好像在等我了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.02,1:16:41.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.88,1:16:48.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好像这个不太顺利
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.41,1:16:51.28,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我没倾斜吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.72,1:16:53.17,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我倾斜了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.86,1:17:14.90,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等、等一下，没搞懂哦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.20,1:17:22.24,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「不打也行w」
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.29,1:17:23.90,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，我刚才在打…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.29,1:17:26.63,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「玩法说明到此结束」
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.73,1:17:29.78,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「仔细观察对手的动作，以K.O.为目标吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.28,1:17:31.22,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.25,1:17:33.33,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那就先试试看吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.36,1:17:33.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊…！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.97,1:17:35.90,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,来了…露露桑…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.89,1:17:38.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.21,1:17:46.36,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.20,1:18:06.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,挺行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.83,1:18:28.42,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不错嘛，刚才那下
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.82,1:18:30.53,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那一拳打得不错…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.83,1:18:39.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,什么东西……
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.47,1:18:43.42,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「出现注意标记就停止出拳，恢复一下」
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.57,1:18:46.41,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.26,1:19:03.67,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，反击！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.08,1:19:05.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,交叉反击！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.86,1:19:08.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好——打中了——
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.12,1:19:11.62,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好快乐……
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.66,1:19:13.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还要打吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.42,1:19:15.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还要打！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.67,1:19:24.39,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我要把你打得稀巴烂
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.99,1:19:26.38,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,话说我是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.97,1:19:28.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哪边？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.54,1:19:30.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶？我，咦？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.75,1:19:33.98,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,为什么你能回血？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.61,1:19:39.77,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,唔，好痛
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.42,1:19:51.83,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「左右倾斜躲开拳头吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.85,1:19:53.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没做到吗
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.68,1:19:55.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.45,1:20:18.94,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,像要挖进去一样
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.82,1:20:22.94,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,打、打、打……
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.43,1:20:27.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶，等等，我要死了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.37,1:20:32.72,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没倾斜成功
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.45,1:20:55.44,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嗯？啊，赢了赢了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.01,1:20:59.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,原来如此，体力先
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.90,1:21:03.20,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,在回合里赢下来，之后就满格了是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.16,1:21:06.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，太好了——！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.87,1:21:09.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,赢了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.87,1:21:10.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,话说
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.31,1:21:12.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好…热…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.18,1:21:19.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,超锻炼身体又好玩
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.41,1:21:23.98,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,而且跟自己对战真不错
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.96,1:21:28.57,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这样刚才跟本尊的恩怨就了结啦
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.36,1:21:31.72,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rChat}「不开空调不行啊」{\r}不是
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.78,1:21:34.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那个，我开着的，但完全……
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.79,1:21:35.77,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好热
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.20,1:21:39.16,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「感觉是最累的」
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.20,1:21:41.29,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过很好玩呢果然还是
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.46,1:21:48.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我挺喜欢拳击的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.71,1:21:53.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,规则什么的、比赛什么的都不太懂
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.10,1:21:57.41,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,但喜欢自己打打沙袋什么的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.27,1:22:00.59,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我挺喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.31,1:22:03.60,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「因为能揍？」
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.65,1:22:08.28,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嘛，也没错，确实挺舒服的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.82,1:22:11.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没有不好的意思
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.68,1:22:12.78,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就是普通地
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.84,1:22:15.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,释放压力…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.92,1:22:18.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,与其说打起来舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.49,1:22:19.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.19,1:22:20.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.61,1:22:23.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,打沙袋…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.09,1:22:27.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,会发出「砰」的一声
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.30,1:22:29.36,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那个声音让人欲罢不能
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.53,1:22:35.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,超棒的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.26,1:22:40.13,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,打下去就会奏响美妙的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.10,1:22:42.96,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,会发出超好的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.33,1:22:44.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,像「梆」那样
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.03,1:22:46.33,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那个声音
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.84,1:22:48.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,会上瘾
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.69,1:22:51.29,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rChat}「这种感觉能理解」{\r}是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.24,1:22:56.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拳击真好玩
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.43,1:22:59.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,太好了，这样我就是真正的露露了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.47,1:23:07.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.87,1:23:11.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,对对，打准了真的会发出很棒的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.92,1:23:16.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,一想到刚才那拳是拳好拳
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.67,1:23:17.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就……
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.59,1:23:22.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,会想打出更好的拳…打出更好的拳…！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.22,1:23:24.59,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,会忍不住去打
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.56,1:23:26.80,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「感觉很适合敲鼓」
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.88,1:23:29.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不，我没什么节奏感，好像挺难的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.74,1:23:33.06,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「目标全世界？」
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.12,1:23:34.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哎呀，就是纯爱好
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.94,1:23:36.60,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就是个爱好
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.65,1:23:39.14,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「感觉能大概一个小时一直打沙袋」
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.35,1:23:40.60,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我想想……
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.64,1:23:44.22,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,打的时候大概一小时吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.79,1:23:49.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大概20分钟算一组
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.43,1:23:54.00,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,做点别的事再来20分钟这样
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.24,1:23:58.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,然后合计大约一小时后
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.48,1:24:01.20,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,能出不少汗
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.19,1:24:05.15,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好玩
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.26,1:24:07.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，来试试排球吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.33,1:24:10.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,排球我不太懂
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.38,1:24:13.11,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「时机接球」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.73,1:24:15.40,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,首先2对2？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.82,1:24:18.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶，排球不能一个人一个人打啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.48,1:24:20.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,算了，试试看
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.50,1:24:26.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,又能见到露露桑了吧，见到冒牌露露桑
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.84,1:24:29.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.16,1:24:32.33,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「一个人打不了的呢……」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.39,1:24:34.58,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,排球原来一个人不行啊……
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.27,1:24:39.28,RURU,,0,0,0,,预备——
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.88,1:24:42.99,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「排球里要和队友一边交换角色」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.05,1:24:45.68,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「一边通过接发球、二传、扣球来将球打回去」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.21,1:24:48.70,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「接下来让我们按顺序练习吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.85,1:24:52.65,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「接球是举起Joy-Con，在球打到的时机向上挥」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.40,1:24:55.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,原来如此，这个我有印象
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.47,1:24:57.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.03,1:25:00.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,别把麦克风打飞了，得小心
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.06,1:25:01.51,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「成为果列奴原吧！」
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.06,1:25:02.06,AN,,0,0,0,,※果列奴：全职猎人，能召唤两只猩猩外形的念兽白色/黑色贤人
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.70,1:25:03.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我一个人当两个人
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.24,1:25:06.36,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「赶紧试试接球吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.72,1:25:08.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,果然……还是需要露露？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.46,1:25:11.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,时机有点早
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.57,1:25:12.70,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等一下，那个……
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.84,1:25:13.94,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是那种类型吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.63,1:25:16.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rGame}「有点早了」{\r}ww
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.02,1:25:21.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大概这样？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.80,1:25:24.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,假的吧，刚才那下绝对晚了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.15,1:25:27.35,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这样算早？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.96,1:25:32.28,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「二传是举起Joy-Con，在球打到的时机向上挥」
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.80,1:25:34.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好好好，二传
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.51,1:25:35.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,二传二传
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.72,1:25:37.72,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，二传
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.90,1:25:41.46,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这样就是把球二传给我了？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.71,1:25:43.28,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那算早吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.29,1:25:46.29,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这样？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.14,1:25:49.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大概要伸多远……
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.69,1:25:51.49,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大概这种程度啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.85,1:25:55.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OKOK，再来稍微练一下二传
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.63,1:25:58.72,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，好像会有哔咔一声——
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.76,1:26:01.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,姿势？动作？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.91,1:26:03.34,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那个出现了之后再做吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.54,1:26:04.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,跳跃？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.64,1:26:07.80,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这是说我得真的跳起来吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.37,1:26:10.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,跳跃……
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.60,1:26:12.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,脚上有判定点吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.22,1:26:14.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不，没有啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.26,1:26:19.77,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「继跳跃、扣球的顺序，练习用力把球打回去」
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.38,1:26:25.38,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「举起Joy-Con，朝球起跳」
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.63,1:26:29.57,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,然后朝球起跳……
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.61,1:26:32.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，等一下，不不、不对
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.75,1:26:33.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.03,1:26:36.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,举起来……OKOK
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.82,1:26:43.60,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,呃…？OKOKOK
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.71,1:26:44.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,重来重来
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.29,1:26:49.49,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，太晚了，懂了懂了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.10,1:26:52.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,跳不起来
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.24,1:26:55.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有点晚了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.04,1:26:58.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,糟了，可能很难……
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.50,1:27:02.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,刚才那个可不OK吧……
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.72,1:27:05.78,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,刚才算OK吗，算了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.03,1:27:10.49,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「举起Joy-Con跳跃之后，是往下挥扣球」
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.22,1:27:14.89,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「跳起来之后试着扣球得分吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.19,1:27:20.60,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好…！扣球好爽
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.30,1:27:23.63,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,白色贤人！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.51,1:27:28.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,先出石头…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.10,1:27:30.52,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,猜拳，布！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.66,1:27:33.44,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嘛，虽然早了点但可以了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.53,1:27:34.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,算是懂了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.13,1:27:40.62,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「最后是拦网练习，举起Joy-Con来防球」
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.82,1:27:42.23,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,跟二传有什么区别
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.24,1:27:48.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拦网
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.67,1:27:49.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.27,1:27:50.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拦网
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.93,1:27:52.80,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,晚了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.89,1:27:53.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OKOKOK
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.00,1:27:57.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,一会儿说早了，一会儿说晚了，真的…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.30,1:27:58.33,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,时机有点
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.25,1:28:01.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,搞不懂
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.35,1:28:03.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不是看到之后再动
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.61,1:28:05.00,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,要凭感觉动
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.83,1:28:10.13,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,别被视野骗了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.15,1:28:11.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,去探气息
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.86,1:28:12.62,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就是现在
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.71,1:28:13.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.32,1:28:15.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.51,1:28:19.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,现在，好
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.18,1:28:27.36,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这里，好，OKOKOK
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.06,1:28:29.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,懂了懂了，能感觉到了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.77,1:28:32.81,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我能行，我做得到，我能打，还能上！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.95,1:28:36.08,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「比赛中要和另一位队友组队」
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.36,1:28:38.96,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「用漂亮的团队合作拿下胜利吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.84,1:28:41.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OKOK，请多指教哦
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.68,1:28:46.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，开打吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.94,1:28:51.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,二传……
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.32,1:28:53.52,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拿5分就赢……
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.43,1:28:56.06,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,球弹得超厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.18,1:28:57.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,要发球咯——
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.39,1:29:02.22,RURU,,0,0,0,,有点不好判断的感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.31,1:29:03.66,RURU,,0,0,0,,接下来接球，接球
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.60,1:29:08.00,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,接下来是扣球…！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.24,1:29:09.28,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.09,1:29:10.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拦网
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.97,1:29:11.90,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拦网拦网
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.99,1:29:12.70,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拦网
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.00,1:29:13.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拦网
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.52,1:29:14.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,二传二传二传
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.60,1:29:15.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,能二传吗二传
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.91,1:29:17.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这谁二传啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.73,1:29:19.81,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不好，排球好难
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.77,1:29:22.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,接下来接球
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.08,1:29:31.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没懂……
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.40,1:29:33.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,排球……不懂
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.71,1:29:36.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,会变成「二传是什么来着」这样
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.81,1:29:39.06,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,什么什么什么，我
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.57,1:29:41.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,刚才那是触身球吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.20,1:29:44.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,裁判先生刚才看到了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.71,1:29:46.72,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,被打到了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.60,1:29:49.57,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,晚了早了早了早了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.62,1:29:50.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,扣球
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.96,1:29:54.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，还行还行，接住了吗？接住了接住了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.45,1:29:55.36,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，一分
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.80,1:29:58.72,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好……！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.83,1:30:00.94,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂亮，干脆
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.80,1:30:05.41,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这是啥？拦网拦网拦网拦网拦网
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.45,1:30:07.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,现在……！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.32,1:30:08.22,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好……
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.34,1:30:09.06,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂亮漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.12,1:30:10.80,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,二传传传传传传
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.80,1:30:14.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,Nice——漂上加亮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.09,1:30:14.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,什么什么
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.96,1:30:16.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,接球，接球
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.34,1:30:17.98,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好接球，好接球
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.19,1:30:19.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,接下来扣球
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.92,1:30:22.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，扣球
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.29,1:30:23.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拦网拦网拦网
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.33,1:30:25.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,二传能二传吗
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.81,1:30:27.23,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,能行能行能行能行
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.29,1:30:28.52,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.38,1:30:32.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,接球接球
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.96,1:30:34.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,接球接球
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.69,1:30:38.56,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,接球……接下来……
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.89,1:30:40.23,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拦网拦网
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.31,1:30:43.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哇没法拦网对人
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.66,1:30:47.19,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,在脑锻炼里也有……
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.09,1:30:49.23,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,接球
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.00,1:30:51.70,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.65,1:30:55.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,早了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.87,1:30:57.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.88,1:31:01.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂亮乘以二！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.56,1:31:04.36,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂亮霍莉漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.18,1:31:06.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,露露霍莉漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.47,1:31:09.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,配合得不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.27,1:31:12.58,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,露露霍莉也好，又或者霍莉露露也好
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.43,1:31:17.38,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,谁谁谁谁，拦网拦网拦网
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.89,1:31:18.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拦网
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.78,1:31:19.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拦网
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.48,1:31:26.59,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,接球…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.38,1:31:33.96,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂上加亮，我来拦网
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.72,1:31:35.98,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拦网这个动作
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.55,1:31:37.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我不懂
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.97,1:31:42.56,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是哪个……接球
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.42,1:31:44.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,Nice漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.58,1:31:46.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,霍莉
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.10,1:31:47.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.18,1:31:49.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,太强了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.98,1:31:56.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,抱歉，我可能拖后腿了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.78,1:32:03.42,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊——出手好晚啊我
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.49,1:32:06.34,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,二传
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.72,1:32:08.57,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,二传，有点早…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.14,1:32:09.95,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,什么什么
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.01,1:32:11.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,接球吗，接球…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.18,1:32:14.19,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,早了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.32,1:32:15.53,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,扣球…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.58,1:32:18.28,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好像说我早了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.45,1:32:19.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,为何
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.34,1:32:20.22,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.71,1:32:21.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,二传
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.74,1:32:22.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,二传
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.85,1:32:23.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,太早了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.10,1:32:26.59,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,下次是接球吗
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.12,1:32:30.53,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这次太晚了又
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.23,1:32:36.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,因为被说太早了……
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.19,1:32:39.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,所以想晚一点来着，但没能成功……
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.73,1:32:42.59,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,再多忍一下也行吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.83,1:32:46.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,忍过头了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.88,1:32:49.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,从刚才开始就一直在打触身球哦
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.82,1:32:55.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这是把球砸到人身上的游戏来着？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.25,1:33:02.00,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,对不起别这表情……
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.27,1:33:03.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,霍莉对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.18,1:33:05.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,霍莉对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.15,1:33:08.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,霍莉对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.95,1:33:11.80,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就稍微让我再来一局吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.04,1:33:14.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,再来一次
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.26,1:33:15.46,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,再来一次
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.98,1:33:19.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，已经不是霍莉了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.71,1:33:20.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,已经被抛弃了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.91,1:33:22.36,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,前·阿基拉又是谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.59,1:33:24.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,前？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.65,1:33:25.79,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,现·阿基拉是？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.60,1:33:29.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,「前」是姓的意思啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.62,1:33:39.60,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,现在，好，厉害厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.00,1:33:44.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有点早了吗，还是晚了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.03,1:33:49.78,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,能当拦网手吗，我
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.15,1:33:54.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我除了往前冲啥也不会
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.40,1:33:58.56,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,比起拦网，不如说我更擅长突进
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.52,1:34:01.38,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好球？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.53,1:34:02.38,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好球啊
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.46,1:34:03.38,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好球！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.88,1:34:05.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,Nice阿基拉～
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.15,1:34:06.19,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,前阿基拉？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.28,1:34:07.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,前、前阿基拉桑
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.42,1:34:10.41,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好……
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.51,1:34:11.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.52,1:34:14.58,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,预备——
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.68,1:34:20.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,接球
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.09,1:34:23.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好接
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.45,1:34:26.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,慢了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.95,1:34:31.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，读「元」吗
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.68,1:34:33.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,现在的阿基拉在哪
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.23,1:34:34.42,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,yu、元……
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.54,1:34:35.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,阿基拉吗
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.63,1:34:43.72,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,距离感完全搞不懂，刚才那个是冲我来的吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.68,1:34:48.58,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,糟了，没搞懂排球…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.95,1:34:49.95,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,二传…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.90,1:34:52.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,先二传…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.55,1:34:54.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,再揍上去
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.72,1:34:58.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,接球
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.83,1:34:59.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嘿…！好
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.01,1:35:01.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,扣球
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.95,1:35:03.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.19,1:35:05.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拦网手拦网手
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.07,1:35:09.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拦不了，OK
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.56,1:35:10.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.20,1:35:13.56,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,只要对拉还能继续就还好
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.97,1:35:15.15,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,接球
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.34,1:35:16.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.07,1:35:17.56,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就是现在，漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.09,1:35:19.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,扣球
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.74,1:35:20.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,晚了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.29,1:35:22.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没绝杀
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.37,1:35:26.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我说那个阿比……穆霍
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.73,1:35:28.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,二传二传二传
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.26,1:35:30.35,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,二传二传——
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.75,1:35:36.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,接球
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.28,1:35:38.23,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,慢了…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.72,1:35:41.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.50,1:35:43.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，绝杀
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.36,1:35:46.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,说不定打得还挺势均力敌的
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.98,1:35:53.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拦网…拦！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.21,1:35:56.12,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.43,1:36:00.77,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,咕……可惜啊
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.38,1:36:03.13,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不错哦，不错
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.11,1:36:05.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,动作挺好的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.04,1:36:07.17,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,接球
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.75,1:36:11.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拿下咯！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.69,1:36:18.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,再来一次……再来！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.38,1:36:20.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我还有点不服气
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.05,1:36:25.22,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,来，二传
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.29,1:36:26.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,来，二传…早了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.18,1:36:28.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过，OK，接上了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.88,1:36:30.44,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂亮——
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.62,1:36:32.13,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂亮，阿基拉…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.37,1:36:35.38,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,真不错
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.76,1:36:38.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,像是会骑鲜红的摩托车的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.14,1:36:40.57,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，预备——
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.99,1:36:51.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,谁？扣球的人谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.01,1:36:52.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.73,1:36:56.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拦网，好
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.59,1:36:59.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,再来一下拦网
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.13,1:37:02.29,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是拦不了的位置
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.25,1:37:04.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,早了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.20,1:37:08.95,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,接球，来了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.17,1:37:10.38,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，早了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.15,1:37:12.15,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,扣下去咯
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.83,1:37:13.97,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好慢……
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.33,1:37:16.49,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嘛，反倒是
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.67,1:37:18.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我打晚了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.83,1:37:20.72,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,早了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.21,1:37:23.29,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没事没事
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.42,1:37:25.42,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,只要对拉还能继续…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.60,1:37:28.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,只要没输就不算输嘛…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.78,1:37:32.15,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,只要没输就行…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.26,1:37:36.06,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,抓住…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.86,1:37:38.67,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.12,1:37:43.42,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,接球
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.09,1:37:47.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,扣球，扣球交给我
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.41,1:37:48.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.18,1:37:49.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,什么？！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.21,1:37:51.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有一手
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.59,1:37:54.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,二传
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.40,1:37:56.29,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.54,1:37:58.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,你们挺厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.09,1:38:00.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，厉害，厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.91,1:38:01.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我也厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.32,1:38:19.29,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好……
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.48,1:38:20.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,来试试吧
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.93,1:38:23.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,露露桑…？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.86,1:38:27.59,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,糟了，要赢哦
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.80,1:38:31.39,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,昨天的敌人就是今天的朋友？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.44,1:38:33.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,露露露露组合…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.13,1:38:36.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,梦幻共演
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.70,1:38:37.60,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,上了！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.63,1:38:41.15,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我们的话一定…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.19,1:38:43.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,能做到，对吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.76,1:38:46.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,时机稍微早了吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.67,1:38:49.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好上加好！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.84,1:38:59.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,很好很好，继续吧
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.66,1:39:02.13,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,接着对拉
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.51,1:39:03.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好球
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.42,1:39:05.60,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,扣球，露露…！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.75,1:39:07.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.52,1:39:09.41,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂亮…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.08,1:39:11.78,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.87,1:39:13.52,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我一人顶两人
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.62,1:39:15.79,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这真的就是……白色露露列…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.84,1:39:16.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,露露列奴？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.79,1:39:20.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,预备——！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.76,1:39:26.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,接球
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.25,1:39:28.65,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嗯，有点早
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.67,1:39:29.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.85,1:39:33.33,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,挺厉害的嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.43,1:39:34.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,可以啊
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.24,1:39:36.49,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是吧空露露
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.37,1:39:39.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.14,1:39:45.19,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,露露桑那件像运动服似的，到底穿的什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.83,1:39:50.90,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是我给她穿的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.85,1:39:58.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,太早了吗，算了无所谓
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.15,1:39:58.80,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,无所谓
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.83,1:39:59.90,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,接上了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.94,1:40:01.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好好
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.25,1:40:03.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不错不错
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.83,1:40:09.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,加油…！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.84,1:40:12.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不想输对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.15,1:40:13.96,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.06,1:40:17.36,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我们同为露露桑…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.88,1:40:20.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,Nice！好球露露
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.87,1:40:24.49,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,露露好球，帅，利落
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.57,1:40:27.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好像耀西……
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.18,1:40:29.00,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,耀西色的，好可爱
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.30,1:40:30.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,像睡衣
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.68,1:40:35.67,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,接球
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.37,1:40:41.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不错，那、那种努力撑住球的感觉很好
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.13,1:40:43.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,可能变厉害了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.35,1:40:47.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,确实在战斗中成长了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.34,1:40:49.28,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，上了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.02,1:40:52.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,上
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.28,1:40:55.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,接球会来吗，接球
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.68,1:40:58.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有点早
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.53,1:40:59.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.37,1:41:05.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,刚才那球……真亏你们能接住
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.80,1:41:06.98,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,真不怕死
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.77,1:41:14.23,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,接球，好
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.96,1:41:16.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,扣球，上了…！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.98,1:41:18.98,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,太晚了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.79,1:41:24.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,接不到，抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.54,1:41:27.42,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,可能有点想拜托她只拦网
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.72,1:41:30.70,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我想当进攻的那个
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.84,1:41:33.46,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,痛，打到我自己了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.65,1:41:34.65,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,算了无所谓
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.41,1:41:36.79,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我这是什么？什么动作
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.86,1:41:40.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还活着没事，只要活着总会有办法
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.04,1:41:42.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,二传不了，因为二传不了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.46,1:41:44.42,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，再二传
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.88,1:41:46.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拜托，拿下吧
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.53,1:41:48.53,RURU,,0,0,0,,接球吗
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.96,1:41:51.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好球，扣球
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.60,1:41:53.13,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,可以拿下哦，是我吗
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.25,1:41:57.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,抱歉，哪、哪个是我？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.10,1:41:59.97,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,你就是我，我就是你
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.16,1:42:02.53,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,你是我，而我是你
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.18,1:42:04.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,混乱了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.98,1:42:11.42,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，赢了w
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.36,1:42:14.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.16,1:42:17.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,完全胜利对吧，大家
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.34,1:42:19.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.94,1:42:23.39,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这就是完全胜利的滋味对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.35,1:42:27.36,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这就是空露露……击球？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.80,1:42:30.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,然后「祭」是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.48,1:42:33.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,新手露露我还能懂
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.40,1:42:36.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,祭露露又是什么？ww
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.84,1:42:39.81,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,「捧上台露露」这样的感觉？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.17,1:42:43.57,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不太懂，这是什么时候做的来着？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.65,1:42:50.65,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,旧露露
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.65,1:42:55.65,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,祭露露
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.88,1:42:57.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,为、为什么是祭呢
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.45,1:42:59.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,节日露露？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.41,1:43:04.33,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.58,1:43:06.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,赢了——……
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.41,1:43:08.95,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,完美地赢了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.16,1:43:11.32,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「一分没丢获胜」
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.52,1:43:15.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rGame}「排球服运动套装」{\r}说是
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.11,1:43:17.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那个贝雷帽想要呢，贝雷帽
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.47,1:43:19.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,在哪能拿到呢
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.87,1:43:21.75,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「嘉年华露露」
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.79,1:43:24.60,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,稍等一下，房间反而有点太冷了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.21,1:43:27.42,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,真不得了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.30,1:43:29.72,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,都成冷库了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.74,1:43:30.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.76,1:43:35.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,隔音室的温度管理很难做呢
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.83,1:43:39.65,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，乒乓球
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.99,1:43:41.69,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「击罐回球」
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.19,1:43:45.57,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊击罐回球听上去挺好玩的
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.74,1:43:47.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,Ping Pong是……
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.74,1:43:49.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,乒乓球？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.18,1:43:55.15,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,乒乓球和Ping Pong的区别我不懂
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.62,1:43:56.66,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有什么不一样？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.72,1:43:58.66,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不一样吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.03,1:44:05.55,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「是乒乓球」
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.99,1:44:07.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,原来一样
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.00,1:44:11.55,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「Ping Pong是英语」
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.59,1:44:17.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,原来如此原来如此
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.63,1:44:19.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.35,1:44:25.40,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,先拿到6分的人获胜是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.01,1:44:29.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,乒个乓
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.69,1:44:30.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,乒各…？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.84,1:44:32.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,听、听上去像pingu一样了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.08,1:44:34.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,乒个乓
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.34,1:44:37.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.94,1:44:39.90,RURU,,0,0,0,,这就去拿下
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.35,1:44:44.57,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「请把Joy-Con朝向画面中心按下按钮」
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.60,1:44:45.49,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,X
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.17,1:44:46.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.99,1:44:49.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，可以可以
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.93,1:44:52.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,上咯
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.97,1:45:00.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那个，朝画面摆好姿势
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.48,1:45:05.57,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等球掉下来之后再……
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.60,1:45:13.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.11,1:45:16.56,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶，刚才是我赢了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.63,1:45:17.66,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，我赢了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.83,1:45:18.97,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好～赢了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.96,1:45:22.95,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,上了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.51,1:45:31.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,瞄准边角
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.92,1:45:35.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,为什么啊，不是打回来了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.85,1:45:38.39,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不是打回来了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.18,1:45:42.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不行吗，知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.06,1:45:53.17,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不能从这块球场
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.83,1:45:56.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,掉出去是吧，好——
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.24,1:45:58.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,做到了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.59,1:46:02.60,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「得在对方球台弹一次才行」
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.83,1:46:03.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.49,1:46:16.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我就不能打出更快更快的球吗
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.55,1:46:21.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，做到了！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.71,1:46:24.70,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，3比1
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.72,1:46:26.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,被拿了一分
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.67,1:46:28.66,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有点不甘心，不过算了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.95,1:46:36.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好痛…啊
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.11,1:46:39.38,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,危险危险危险手指要折了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.06,1:46:47.22,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，用力过猛了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.95,1:46:50.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,再来再来再来再来再来再来
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.04,1:47:02.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊——好像又过头了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.86,1:47:04.90,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,再来一次！
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.94,1:47:06.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,输给自己了啊，我
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.90,1:47:09.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不是你不是你
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.21,1:47:11.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,该怪的是……
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.31,1:47:12.52,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是我不好
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.37,1:47:17.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是落不进场地里的我不好
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.07,1:47:18.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，OK
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.01,1:47:28.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,空气冰球也是那样
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.02,1:47:30.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,自己
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.03,1:47:34.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有像是跟自己战斗的感觉呢
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.28,1:47:36.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，漂上加亮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.38,1:47:41.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,自己把自己的球打进自己的洞里那种
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.02,1:47:43.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有那种感觉对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.41,1:47:45.52,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是不是有点……
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.58,1:47:48.13,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我发球是不是太烂了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.95,1:47:57.39,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶，等等，可能有点菜……
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.18,1:48:02.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好……！做到了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.79,1:48:08.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,发球都变得像假动作一样了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.27,1:48:13.32,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「空气冰球尤其，一往前冲就容易自灭」
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.35,1:48:14.17,RURU,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.22,1:48:15.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,很难呢
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.94,1:48:17.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,赢了——
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.89,1:48:21.33,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我赢了——
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.68,1:48:28.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,意外地攒了不少分嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.13,1:48:33.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,谢谢啦
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.86,1:48:36.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嗯？你谁啊
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.57,1:48:37.49,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,桑拿健
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.00,1:48:39.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,桑拿健！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.14,1:48:43.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等等，我是不是不小心又再来一次了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.19,1:48:46.13,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大概不小心按了再来一次
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.89,1:48:48.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那个瓶的东西我有点在意……
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.27,1:48:51.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不想试试打瓶子吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.88,1:48:56.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，不是瓶子
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.63,1:48:57.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是击罐
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.59,1:48:58.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这个这个这个
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.01,1:49:00.98,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,A键，这次是A啊
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.32,1:49:03.13,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,刚才还是X呢
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.21,1:49:09.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不是打罐子……
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.81,1:49:11.15,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是人啊
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.13,1:49:14.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶，我还以为是要打罐子呢
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.57,1:49:16.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,对边是个人呢
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.76,1:49:20.23,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「尽量多打回去」
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.27,1:49:21.96,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就是要对拉对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.87,1:49:24.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.41,1:49:49.20,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,总觉得
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.30,1:49:51.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不太顺利啊
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.91,1:50:30.81,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,可惜…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.92,1:50:33.19,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那个黄金罐子好想要……
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.93,1:50:35.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,黄金Rush…！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.62,1:50:40.78,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊……这个算怎么样的？分算拿的多的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.95,1:50:47.94,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嘛，不过意外的还行？67……
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.48,1:50:52.86,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,意外地乒乓球也还挺算可以？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.15,1:50:55.81,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,意外、意外、意外得太意外了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.43,1:51:00.71,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「个人最佳」「我觉得挺厉害的！」
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.96,1:51:04.86,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,意外地能当练习呢，刚才那个打罐子的
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.36,1:51:07.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,篮球……
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.38,1:51:13.58,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「2对2团队战，运球传球晃过对手，投篮！」
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.33,1:51:15.35,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,Goal…不对
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.40,1:51:17.41,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不是把球门射进门……
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.59,1:51:19.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,「把球射进对方的球门——！」
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.59,1:51:20.59,AN,,0,0,0,,※《超！エキサイティン！》：\N美国战斗圆顶的神必广告
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.49,1:51:20.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,「战斗圆顶！」
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.60,1:51:26.21,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「拿来练三分球投篮正好，目标完美！」
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.24,1:51:28.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大家一起投……啊
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.00,1:51:30.67,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,投篮不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.78,1:51:35.67,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,投篮的那个，就是……
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.73,1:51:38.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,罚球那东西，我还挺喜欢的来着
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.14,1:51:40.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,超！兴奋！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.66,1:51:43.16,RURU,,0,0,0,,战斗圆顶！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.59,1:51:48.36,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,虽然在不起眼但很重要的地方搞错了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.02,1:51:51.77,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,把球射进对方的球门，才对
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.55,1:51:59.33,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「哆啦A梦也在战斗巨蛋出场啦！」
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.98,1:52:05.90,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「连投进5球吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.47,1:52:10.38,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶，那个像罚球的是哪个？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.75,1:52:12.86,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,罚球……罚球是这个吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.22,1:52:16.77,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没有罚球吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.03,1:52:21.42,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「不模仿一下声音吗？」
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.46,1:52:24.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦的声音模仿的世界毁灭级不像
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.18,1:52:26.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦战斗……
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.45,1:52:28.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\fs64}非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.77,1:52:31.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,稍微玩一下吧
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.86,1:52:37.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,真的做不到
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.97,1:52:38.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.67,1:52:40.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,L和
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.88,1:52:43.60,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.72,1:52:44.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.04,1:52:46.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.69,1:52:53.66,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么回事，返回不了了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.86,1:53:01.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,Joy-Con双持的话……
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.37,1:53:06.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等w
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.70,1:53:09.35,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,稍、稍等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.11,1:53:13.09,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「用一支Joy-Con操作」
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.59,1:53:17.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,只用一支Joy-Con
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.00,1:53:19.35,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就是说
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.66,1:53:23.29,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,用哪边的
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.48,1:53:26.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,什么意思诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.31,1:53:30.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,返回了……
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.80,1:53:33.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.94,1:53:35.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我刚才没看，现在……
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.02,1:53:37.17,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,才注意到
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.33,1:53:39.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这是2人到4人的游戏
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.01,1:53:42.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哼——
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.40,1:53:51.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,其实完全不差人就是了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.91,1:53:53.22,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我后面
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.80,1:53:54.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好几只呢
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.01,1:53:57.20,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,完全不缺人
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.49,1:54:01.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有好几只呢
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.62,1:54:05.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.63,1:54:08.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不要松懈自己的凝
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.31,1:54:11.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等能看见了再重来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.03,1:54:15.73,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「在规定时间内把25个球尽量多投进球门吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.42,1:54:20.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,三分球……这不就是罚球吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.42,1:54:25.57,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,……我只知道罚球啊
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.12,1:54:31.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好菜啊
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.49,1:54:35.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,打得好…吗
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.24,1:54:40.00,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,菜吗
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.51,1:54:46.72,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，好像有点难
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.98,1:54:52.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,右手只是扶着
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.75,1:54:56.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,安西教练……我想帮忙……
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.00,1:54:59.41,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我一直按着ZR啊
Dialogue: 0,1:54:59.43,1:55:00.44,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嘿呀
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.77,1:55:09.78,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,可以可以，我可能还挺行
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.53,1:55:15.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,除了拿不住以外都挺强
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.16,1:55:18.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，好像也并非……
Dialogue: 0,1:55:20.62,1:55:21.42,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:55:23.75,1:55:24.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂亮漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.70,1:55:29.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,可惜
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.07,1:55:40.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,可以可以
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.48,1:55:44.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，还挺顺的
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.28,1:55:46.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么样——
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.34,1:55:53.57,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,个人最佳，感觉再玩一次也好
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.54,1:55:57.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉还能再突破一点
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.97,1:56:06.72,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.38,1:56:10.59,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,把球射进——
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.63,1:56:28.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,可能有点菜……
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.60,1:56:44.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊……感觉意外地，前面反而玩得更好
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.67,1:57:19.96,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,咦，刚才那把还更厉害点
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.63,1:57:29.13,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就算没有时间限制……
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.21,1:57:32.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,刚才我进了几个来着
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.35,1:57:35.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,投的位置太低了吗……
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.23,1:57:39.12,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「和挥动的力度有关吗」
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.18,1:57:41.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大概相关吧，大概
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.46,1:57:43.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大概肯定……
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.16,1:57:47.57,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,在最高位置投的话能行
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.21,1:57:59.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,看球
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.84,1:58:10.39,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好像有点难
Dialogue: 0,1:58:17.54,1:58:19.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,刚才那个，好像有点可惜
Dialogue: 0,1:58:20.65,1:58:23.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,疑？最初那回投的最好的说法可能成立？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.38,1:58:38.86,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.78,1:58:44.81,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,完全进不去
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.58,1:58:59.58,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这球如何
Dialogue: 0,1:59:04.60,1:59:08.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不啊……完全进不去……
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.14,1:59:12.44,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「太真实了这个失败率」
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.84,1:59:15.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是啊……挺真实的……
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.87,1:59:18.41,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,再来再来再来…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.47,1:59:22.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好像路径有点弯……吗
Dialogue: 0,1:59:26.37,1:59:29.69,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「像是Boss战的初次挑战削血削得最多那样」
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.88,1:59:31.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是有呢
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.99,1:59:33.34,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,先拿好
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.13,1:59:35.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,三、二
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.55,1:59:36.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,一
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.32,1:59:37.65,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，拿起来
Dialogue: 0,1:59:37.74,1:59:39.62,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，拿起来往上抬
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.65,1:59:40.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,投出去
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.65,1:59:43.78,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拿起来、抬起来、投出去
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.97,1:59:50.36,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,太用力了？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.81,1:59:54.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不用那么刻意，放松一点
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.76,1:59:55.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,轻飘飘的
Dialogue: 0,1:59:56.72,1:59:57.72,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,轻飘飘的
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.13,2:00:00.19,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,轻飘飘的
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.57,2:00:02.57,RURU,,0,0,0,,轻飘飘的
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.00,2:00:06.41,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过总觉得好可惜
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.93,2:00:09.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,明明感觉真的能进呢
Dialogue: 0,2:00:18.89,2:00:21.94,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,到头来第一次反而是打得最好的？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.51,2:00:28.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过罚球也挺好玩的嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:00:29.08,2:00:31.58,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哇，投不进真的好不甘心啊
Dialogue: 0,2:00:37.61,2:00:39.44,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,菜啊
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.92,2:00:42.42,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,到底是哪里不对呢
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.65,2:00:50.22,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,其实时间也没那么宽裕……
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.99,2:00:55.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不对，也不是使劲就行的
Dialogue: 0,2:00:56.38,2:00:58.40,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「难道在用点赞握法？」
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.44,2:00:59.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那个……
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.65,2:01:04.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有点接近点赞握法的……握法……饼
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.17,2:01:06.29,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,握着的饼
Dialogue: 0,2:01:07.83,2:01:10.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,握法可能还挺独特的
Dialogue: 0,2:01:14.09,2:01:17.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉握法有点像打排球的时候吧
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.77,2:01:42.52,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊好像……打得好了点？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:12.93,2:02:13.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,渣操了
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.82,2:02:26.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嗯……可惜
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.67,2:02:30.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,可惜——
Dialogue: 0,2:02:46.23,2:02:49.77,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，不过十四个……算怎么样
Dialogue: 0,2:02:50.64,2:02:52.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,厉害不
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.16,2:02:54.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,新纪录……
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.57,2:02:57.79,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.01,2:03:00.44,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,个人最佳更新了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.67,2:03:06.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,话说那个，像排球似的蓝红白配色的……
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.33,2:03:09.78,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那些球计数是乘2的啊
Dialogue: 0,2:03:10.91,2:03:13.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好……超过了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:13.97,2:03:16.13,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,结果是怎么回事呢，好像……
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.17,2:03:19.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,状态确实挺好，但不知道为什么这么好
Dialogue: 0,2:03:20.95,2:03:22.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，漂亮
Dialogue: 0,2:03:22.52,2:03:24.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,原来那些叫彩球啊
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.08,2:03:28.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,高尔夫
Dialogue: 0,2:03:28.31,2:03:31.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,高尔夫我也没打过呢
Dialogue: 0,2:03:32.24,2:03:35.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,也就玩过些高尔夫球的游戏而已
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.55,2:03:39.17,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「用最少的杆数瞄准进洞吧」
Dialogue: 0,2:03:39.19,2:03:43.08,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「可以在自然丰饶的27洞球场游玩」
Dialogue: 0,2:03:44.68,2:03:46.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，来试试吧
Dialogue: 0,2:03:47.38,2:03:50.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,初级……嘛初级就可以……吧？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:54.07,2:03:56.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,呃，先把这个……
Dialogue: 0,2:03:57.92,2:03:59.59,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「《大众高尔夫》之类的？」
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.65,2:04:01.29,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我没玩过
Dialogue: 0,2:04:01.62,2:04:03.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶？不过好像有点想试试
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.05,2:04:06.51,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「露露酱感觉绝对和高尔夫无缘」
Dialogue: 0,2:04:06.65,2:04:07.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,为什么呀？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:08.32,2:04:12.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,说不定她每天都狂打高尔夫呢
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.81,2:04:14.35,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,凭什么说
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.45,2:04:15.67,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,她看上去无缘啊
Dialogue: 0,2:04:16.18,2:04:17.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶不过嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.74,2:04:19.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,实际上确实无缘啦
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.92,2:04:23.14,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「毕竟是阳角嘛」
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.16,2:04:25.56,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,对对对对，是这样没错
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.26,2:04:27.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,虽然是这样……
Dialogue: 0,2:04:28.99,2:04:31.24,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「感觉是社交场上的游戏嘛」
Dialogue: 0,2:04:31.98,2:04:33.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嘛嘛嘛，从现在开始
Dialogue: 0,2:04:33.89,2:04:35.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,从现在开始……
Dialogue: 0,2:04:35.54,2:04:36.52,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,在这里
Dialogue: 0,2:04:36.57,2:04:37.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,先练着
Dialogue: 0,2:04:37.95,2:04:43.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,现在在游戏里练好，说不定哪天在社交场上能用上嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:04:43.94,2:04:44.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.42,2:04:47.38,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「首先从基础的空挥开始」
Dialogue: 0,2:04:47.40,2:04:50.30,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「按站姿、挥杆的顺序练习」
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.00,2:04:53.48,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「Joy-Con朝下」
Dialogue: 0,2:04:59.57,2:05:00.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉会撞到呢
Dialogue: 0,2:05:03.22,2:05:04.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等等等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,2:05:06.12,2:05:06.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,痛
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.56,2:05:16.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,像那样挥杆可能有点做不到
Dialogue: 0,2:05:17.86,2:05:18.97,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,能行吗
Dialogue: 0,2:05:29.67,2:05:32.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,挥杆轨迹会变小一点
Dialogue: 0,2:05:35.99,2:05:38.36,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rGame}「一边按着ZR一边挥杆」{\r}……
Dialogue: 0,2:05:40.85,2:05:42.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,姑且也不是打不了
Dialogue: 0,2:05:44.65,2:05:46.00,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，OK
Dialogue: 0,2:05:47.08,2:05:48.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,对对，我的空间
Dialogue: 0,2:05:48.76,2:05:49.66,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有点那个
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.12,2:05:51.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,太窄了
Dialogue: 0,2:05:57.74,2:05:58.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.18,2:06:01.96,RURU,,0,0,0,,打……
Dialogue: 0,2:06:02.14,2:06:03.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,打出去呀……
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.52,2:06:04.90,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还是有点困难吗
Dialogue: 0,2:06:11.67,2:06:12.57,RURU,,0,0,0,,挥啊！
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.20,2:06:15.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,挥杆啊我自己，为什么不挥
Dialogue: 0,2:06:21.27,2:06:22.28,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不打呢
Dialogue: 0,2:06:30.42,2:06:31.66,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大概不行吧
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.52,2:06:44.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,球杆不听话
Dialogue: 0,2:06:46.18,2:06:47.12,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这样
Dialogue: 0,2:06:48.50,2:06:49.40,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那样
Dialogue: 0,2:06:52.82,2:06:53.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊疼疼疼……
Dialogue: 0,2:06:53.75,2:06:55.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,朝下摆好架势……
Dialogue: 0,2:06:56.59,2:06:58.41,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,朝下摆好架势……啊这啊
Dialogue: 0,2:06:58.45,2:06:59.53,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊抱歉抱歉……
Dialogue: 0,2:06:59.97,2:07:01.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,什么啊这是……什么啊这是
Dialogue: 0,2:07:02.56,2:07:03.72,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，打到了……
Dialogue: 0,2:07:07.17,2:07:10.34,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「好球，紫色条显示击球力度」
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.01,2:07:15.45,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「挥得快就是大力量，挥得慢就是小力量」
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.89,2:07:17.96,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「那么用大力量挥一杆吧」
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.49,2:07:19.95,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,朝下摆好姿势……
Dialogue: 0,2:07:20.67,2:07:21.97,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,朝下摆好姿势
Dialogue: 0,2:07:24.15,2:07:25.38,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,朝、朝下
Dialogue: 0,2:07:25.47,2:07:26.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,给我摆好啊
Dialogue: 0,2:07:30.32,2:07:31.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等一下……ww
Dialogue: 0,2:07:32.04,2:07:33.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,搞不太懂……
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.28,2:07:41.72,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「好像挥得太用力了」
Dialogue: 0,2:07:41.87,2:07:43.18,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「再慢一点」
Dialogue: 0,2:07:43.23,2:07:44.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉……
Dialogue: 0,2:07:46.31,2:07:47.70,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有点眼熟的提示
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.57,2:07:53.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,2:07:54.24,2:07:58.31,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「挥杆准备时，把力度线抬到想打的力度」
Dialogue: 0,2:07:59.93,2:08:00.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,2:08:10.05,2:08:12.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么样，力道控制住了吗……
Dialogue: 0,2:08:12.73,2:08:14.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊有点过头了，OKOK……
Dialogue: 0,2:08:16.57,2:08:17.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好像太弱了
Dialogue: 0,2:08:18.43,2:08:20.70,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,控制力道好难啊……
Dialogue: 0,2:08:22.37,2:08:23.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OKOKOK
Dialogue: 0,2:08:23.71,2:08:24.90,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,可以哦
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.16,2:08:29.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有点太强了
Dialogue: 0,2:08:34.36,2:08:35.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,太强了
Dialogue: 0,2:08:38.25,2:08:39.43,RURU,,0,0,0,,太弱
Dialogue: 0,2:08:41.78,2:08:42.79,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,弱
Dialogue: 0,2:08:45.22,2:08:46.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,强
Dialogue: 0,2:08:48.44,2:08:50.34,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有点…微妙
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.94,2:08:53.20,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,太强了
Dialogue: 0,2:08:57.40,2:08:58.59,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,又太弱了
Dialogue: 0,2:09:02.09,2:09:04.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊OKOKOK，好——
Dialogue: 0,2:09:05.32,2:09:08.58,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「球洞近的时候，也需要轻一点的击球」
Dialogue: 0,2:09:08.60,2:09:10.46,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「这次用轻的力度打打看吧」
Dialogue: 0,2:09:10.55,2:09:12.39,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，不过刚才已经打出来了呢
Dialogue: 0,2:09:20.61,2:09:21.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,强吗……
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.53,2:09:24.52,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是这样吗……
Dialogue: 0,2:09:32.03,2:09:33.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，完美
Dialogue: 0,2:09:43.07,2:09:44.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,打直……
Dialogue: 0,2:09:46.07,2:09:48.03,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「不扭手腕击球」
Dialogue: 0,2:09:48.59,2:09:50.41,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「球杆朝下摆好架势」
Dialogue: 0,2:09:51.61,2:09:53.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,直直的打出去
Dialogue: 0,2:09:55.65,2:09:56.81,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,居然？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:59.02,2:10:00.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是说偏了吗这个
Dialogue: 0,2:10:18.39,2:10:21.49,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我看着的这边，才是直的！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:22.32,2:10:24.77,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是这里，这里才是直的对吧
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.82,2:10:26.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没错吧
Dialogue: 0,2:10:29.75,2:10:32.79,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rGame}「中间手腕是否弯了呢？」{\r}是吗
Dialogue: 0,2:10:37.25,2:10:37.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是这里哦
Dialogue: 0,2:10:38.00,2:10:38.95,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,直的
Dialogue: 0,2:10:40.54,2:10:41.56,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，直的
Dialogue: 0,2:11:08.22,2:11:10.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,高尔夫玩不明白——
Dialogue: 0,2:11:11.43,2:11:13.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,在家玩大概很困难
Dialogue: 0,2:11:33.05,2:11:34.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，成功了……
Dialogue: 0,2:11:35.24,2:11:37.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是位置上来说有点困难吗
Dialogue: 0,2:11:38.58,2:11:40.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那可能是有点……
Dialogue: 0,2:11:41.85,2:11:43.78,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「这可没法在社交场上露脸啊」
Dialogue: 0,2:11:44.10,2:11:48.60,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「练习辛苦了！最后介绍两个击球诀窍」
Dialogue: 0,2:11:48.73,2:11:53.31,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「第一个，细致地用上键调整姿势」
Dialogue: 0,2:11:53.33,2:11:54.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OKOKOK，就是这个吧
Dialogue: 0,2:11:56.33,2:11:58.10,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「在空挥或者击球之前」
Dialogue: 0,2:11:58.12,2:12:00.97,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「养成按上键的习惯，进步应该也会更快」
Dialogue: 0,2:12:01.00,2:12:02.06,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OKOKK
Dialogue: 0,2:12:02.69,2:12:04.05,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「{\alpha&H80&}第二个，击球前先{\r}来空挥吧」
Dialogue: 0,2:12:04.59,2:12:07.54,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「不按ZR直接挥的话就是空挥」
Dialogue: 0,2:12:07.56,2:12:10.40,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「先找准感觉再击球吧」
Dialogue: 0,2:12:11.06,2:12:12.16,RURU,,0,0,0,,OK——！
Dialogue: 0,2:12:13.32,2:12:15.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，先试试吧
Dialogue: 0,2:12:18.58,2:12:21.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,肯定总能想办法打好的
Dialogue: 0,2:12:25.47,2:12:26.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,第一杆
Dialogue: 0,2:12:27.94,2:12:29.17,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,朝下……
Dialogue: 0,2:12:31.86,2:12:33.79,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这个是空挥对吧，空挥……
Dialogue: 0,2:12:36.01,2:12:37.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这样……
Dialogue: 0,2:12:41.50,2:12:42.36,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,2:12:44.96,2:12:46.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,朝下
Dialogue: 0,2:12:57.29,2:12:59.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎、怎么打不出去，下……
Dialogue: 0,2:13:00.11,2:13:02.22,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是在下面，是在下面的……
Dialogue: 0,2:13:03.16,2:13:04.66,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，飞了
Dialogue: 0,2:13:05.18,2:13:07.81,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我是不是弯得特别厉害？
Dialogue: 0,2:13:09.37,2:13:10.06,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,手臂
Dialogue: 0,2:13:10.67,2:13:12.78,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,第二杆，这要飞多远啊？
Dialogue: 0,2:13:12.86,2:13:14.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,朝下
Dialogue: 0,2:13:18.01,2:13:19.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,掌握感觉吧
Dialogue: 0,2:13:25.66,2:13:27.33,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,来空挥吧，OKOK
Dialogue: 0,2:13:27.39,2:13:29.20,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,空挥空挥空挥
Dialogue: 0,2:13:29.54,2:13:30.12,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,空挥
Dialogue: 0,2:13:30.33,2:13:31.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,空挥
Dialogue: 0,2:13:33.41,2:13:34.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，飞了
Dialogue: 0,2:13:37.03,2:13:38.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:13:39.27,2:13:40.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,越过池塘了
Dialogue: 0,2:13:43.84,2:13:44.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,2:13:44.59,2:13:45.56,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉还行？
Dialogue: 0,2:13:59.39,2:14:00.19,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,飞吧…！
Dialogue: 0,2:14:07.15,2:14:09.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,球、球道，球道
Dialogue: 0,2:14:11.45,2:14:13.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,朝下摆好架势
Dialogue: 0,2:14:16.87,2:14:17.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,空挥
Dialogue: 0,2:14:17.80,2:14:18.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,空挥
Dialogue: 0,2:14:19.10,2:14:19.96,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,空挥
Dialogue: 0,2:14:31.87,2:14:32.95,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,飞太过？
Dialogue: 0,2:14:35.16,2:14:36.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不对，意外地刚刚好
Dialogue: 0,2:14:36.93,2:14:37.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,果岭
Dialogue: 0,2:14:39.46,2:14:40.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,第五杆
Dialogue: 0,2:14:41.54,2:14:46.44,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「朝下摆好架势，慢慢小幅挥杆」
Dialogue: 0,2:14:46.71,2:14:48.28,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,来瞄准球洞
Dialogue: 0,2:14:53.27,2:14:55.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大概这样…？太小了
Dialogue: 0,2:15:04.76,2:15:06.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，太用力了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:15:08.52,2:15:09.57,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,吼难
Dialogue: 0,2:15:13.02,2:15:15.77,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,朝下摆好姿势，稍微——
Dialogue: 0,2:15:21.78,2:15:23.17,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,做到啦
Dialogue: 0,2:15:24.97,2:15:26.56,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉好像还行？
Dialogue: 0,2:15:28.16,2:15:30.53,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，意外的好像抓到诀窍了
Dialogue: 0,2:15:34.34,2:15:36.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这样一来，高尔夫就已经……
Dialogue: 0,2:15:38.99,2:15:40.38,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,可以当个消遣
Dialogue: 0,2:15:47.68,2:15:50.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好球啊
Dialogue: 0,2:15:50.75,2:15:53.38,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,玉屋飞了呀～
Dialogue: 0,2:15:56.22,2:15:57.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，长草区
Dialogue: 0,2:15:58.78,2:16:01.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,然后，呃，该往哪儿打啊这个
Dialogue: 0,2:16:02.84,2:16:04.38,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,总之就是没什么问题吧
Dialogue: 0,2:16:04.47,2:16:07.81,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「击球前要关注击球力度条和小地图」
Dialogue: 0,2:16:08.59,2:16:12.83,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「以白点的数量为基准决定击球力度吧」
Dialogue: 0,2:16:40.95,2:16:41.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,如何
Dialogue: 0,2:16:43.27,2:16:45.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊不过意外的漂亮？
Dialogue: 0,2:16:49.25,2:16:50.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,然后……
Dialogue: 0,2:16:51.09,2:16:52.38,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,朝下
Dialogue: 0,2:16:54.47,2:16:56.90,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，这样也还是太强了
Dialogue: 0,2:16:59.88,2:17:03.23,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,再来再来再来再来，朝下……
Dialogue: 0,2:17:04.86,2:17:06.52,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶？太强太强太强
Dialogue: 0,2:17:10.52,2:17:11.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,太强了
Dialogue: 0,2:17:12.80,2:17:16.04,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「在决斗大师里见到的挥杆速度草」
Dialogue: 0,2:17:18.51,2:17:19.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是这么回事吗
Dialogue: 0,2:17:20.69,2:17:21.81,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大概这样吧
Dialogue: 0,2:17:21.92,2:17:24.46,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,终于调好力度了
Dialogue: 0,2:17:25.28,2:17:27.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,抑制不住力量啊
Dialogue: 0,2:17:31.04,2:17:31.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好……
Dialogue: 0,2:17:33.31,2:17:35.90,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,挺难的，好深奥啊
Dialogue: 0,2:17:47.89,2:17:51.82,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「左右移动能改变击球方向」
Dialogue: 0,2:17:52.56,2:17:53.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,左右动……
Dialogue: 0,2:17:54.70,2:17:57.39,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊——原来如此
Dialogue: 0,2:17:57.88,2:18:01.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OKOK，那在这里全力打出……
Dialogue: 0,2:18:02.01,2:18:03.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,可以吧
Dialogue: 0,2:18:05.48,2:18:07.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等一下……呃……
Dialogue: 0,2:18:16.43,2:18:17.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,如何——
Dialogue: 0,2:18:17.66,2:18:19.58,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，感觉要掉到一些不太好的地方了
Dialogue: 0,2:18:19.63,2:18:20.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没这事吗还是
Dialogue: 0,2:18:24.90,2:18:26.46,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不会进沙坑，没事
Dialogue: 0,2:18:26.54,2:18:28.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,界外是什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:18:30.84,2:18:32.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这又是什么？界外是？
Dialogue: 0,2:18:34.31,2:18:35.66,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,界外又是什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,2:18:42.22,2:18:43.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,太弱……
Dialogue: 0,2:18:45.20,2:18:47.35,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「类似保龄球的洗沟」
Dialogue: 0,2:18:47.42,2:18:49.01,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「就是出界的意思」
Dialogue: 0,2:18:49.49,2:18:51.84,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「是毕业生吧」
Dialogue: 0,2:18:54.92,2:18:56.94,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那还是这边更好吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:19:12.77,2:19:14.52,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,弯的离谱——
Dialogue: 0,2:19:18.69,2:19:19.49,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,长草区……
Dialogue: 0,2:19:22.08,2:19:23.34,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,第五杆
Dialogue: 0,2:19:24.46,2:19:26.42,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,稍微往这边侧一点……
Dialogue: 0,2:19:40.85,2:19:41.72,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,中啊！
Dialogue: 0,2:19:42.73,2:19:43.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,打的什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,2:19:45.76,2:19:49.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,算了算了，飞起来了就行吧……
Dialogue: 0,2:19:50.58,2:19:51.53,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉像
Dialogue: 0,2:19:52.53,2:19:54.67,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,粘在身上了
Dialogue: 0,2:19:55.22,2:19:56.13,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,球杆
Dialogue: 0,2:19:57.65,2:19:59.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,朝下摆好
Dialogue: 0,2:20:00.47,2:20:02.23,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,击球击球
Dialogue: 0,2:20:19.69,2:20:21.29,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,2:20:26.38,2:20:29.67,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不管想往哪里打……不，都没法摆直啊
Dialogue: 0,2:20:30.77,2:20:32.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,往下摆好……
Dialogue: 0,2:20:40.54,2:20:42.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好像……那个……
Dialogue: 0,2:20:43.04,2:20:44.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,力度……
Dialogue: 0,2:20:45.13,2:20:46.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没法控制……
Dialogue: 0,2:21:09.34,2:21:11.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,为何？！这根球杆…
Dialogue: 0,2:21:12.79,2:21:13.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,球杆…！
Dialogue: 0,2:21:14.91,2:21:17.00,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哦不过……打出去了
Dialogue: 0,2:21:20.43,2:21:23.44,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「高尔夫果然不适合吧w（空间上）」
Dialogue: 0,2:21:23.71,2:21:25.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大概是这样吧
Dialogue: 0,2:21:34.94,2:21:36.70,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,上啊——
Dialogue: 0,2:21:40.35,2:21:42.12,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，啊，这不是界外吗
Dialogue: 0,2:21:42.14,2:21:43.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这草的颜色
Dialogue: 0,2:21:45.13,2:21:47.00,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怪怪的，不过无所谓
Dialogue: 0,2:21:48.62,2:21:50.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,无所谓吗……好
Dialogue: 0,2:21:57.83,2:21:58.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,弱…！
Dialogue: 0,2:22:01.12,2:22:04.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,话说这个不能进沙坑是吗
Dialogue: 0,2:22:04.30,2:22:06.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,十杆还挺……
Dialogue: 0,2:22:08.18,2:22:09.62,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉有点多了
Dialogue: 0,2:22:17.09,2:22:18.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,沙坑……
Dialogue: 0,2:22:19.22,2:22:21.44,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「沙坑可以进，但很难打出来」
Dialogue: 0,2:22:21.52,2:22:22.40,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不妙啊
Dialogue: 0,2:22:32.93,2:22:35.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,飞太远了——
Dialogue: 0,2:22:41.17,2:22:44.53,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,呃……先空挥……说的是啊
Dialogue: 0,2:22:45.37,2:22:49.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,正在向我说快点找找感觉
Dialogue: 0,2:23:01.28,2:23:03.79,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是我力气太大了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:23:08.04,2:23:09.53,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,一般来说的话，应该更……
Dialogue: 0,2:23:10.25,2:23:13.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这样，一点点慢慢靠近的吧，这个？
Dialogue: 0,2:23:15.07,2:23:16.76,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「20米往返跑？」
Dialogue: 0,2:23:18.76,2:23:20.12,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没自信了w
Dialogue: 0,2:23:20.87,2:23:22.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不，不过也还好
Dialogue: 0,2:23:22.09,2:23:23.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还可以还可以，好
Dialogue: 0,2:23:24.59,2:23:27.94,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,再也不进沙坑了，绝对
Dialogue: 0,2:23:30.52,2:23:32.17,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rGame}「放弃」{\r}是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,2:23:39.87,2:23:41.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,放弃什么意思
Dialogue: 0,2:23:42.92,2:23:44.59,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,强制……
Dialogue: 0,2:23:45.81,2:23:47.00,RURU,,0,0,0,,性质的……
Dialogue: 0,2:23:47.73,2:23:49.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那种东西？
Dialogue: 0,2:23:49.15,2:23:51.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶？杆数是确定的啊
Dialogue: 0,2:23:51.62,2:23:53.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不是要到进去为止吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:23:54.04,2:23:57.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是说我太慢了吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:23:58.05,2:23:59.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,击球诀窍……
Dialogue: 0,2:23:59.64,2:24:03.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,可能确实有点窄吧
Dialogue: 0,2:24:03.14,2:24:03.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,时间……
Dialogue: 0,2:24:08.71,2:24:12.34,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嘛，不过，再一点点，小玩一点……
Dialogue: 0,2:24:12.38,2:24:14.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,去玩拇指相扑吧
Dialogue: 0,2:24:14.24,2:24:15.36,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拇指相扑……
Dialogue: 0,2:24:18.37,2:24:20.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,用同一个用户玩
Dialogue: 0,2:24:20.04,2:24:21.95,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶，手指要怎么映射啊？
Dialogue: 0,2:24:26.58,2:24:28.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,把拇指竖起来……
Dialogue: 0,2:24:28.53,2:24:29.53,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,点赞……
Dialogue: 0,2:24:30.50,2:24:31.56,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,点赞……
Dialogue: 0,2:24:33.09,2:24:34.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,点赞点赞……
Dialogue: 0,2:24:40.14,2:24:41.20,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:24:42.77,2:24:43.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,点赞
Dialogue: 0,2:24:46.71,2:24:48.33,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，OK
Dialogue: 0,2:24:51.65,2:24:53.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,需要腾出空间那种？
Dialogue: 0,2:24:53.44,2:24:56.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等等，拇指相扑要空间的吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:24:56.78,2:24:58.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,掰手腕才要吧
Dialogue: 0,2:24:59.64,2:25:01.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哦～会动会动……
Dialogue: 0,2:25:02.85,2:25:03.81,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,开始
Dialogue: 0,2:25:04.00,2:25:04.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,手指
Dialogue: 0,2:25:05.24,2:25:09.01,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「把Joy-Con竖起来拿着，用拇指按」
Dialogue: 0,2:25:10.00,2:25:10.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:25:11.16,2:25:14.06,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「首先是左右移动手指的练习」
Dialogue: 0,2:25:19.75,2:25:21.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,做了露露美甲
Dialogue: 0,2:25:21.63,2:25:24.44,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「靠左右倾斜尝试摆动手指」
Dialogue: 0,2:25:24.48,2:25:26.57,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嗯嗯，可以可以
Dialogue: 0,2:25:28.80,2:25:31.18,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「接下来是按下手指的练习」
Dialogue: 0,2:25:31.23,2:25:32.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,按下？
Dialogue: 0,2:25:34.01,2:25:36.73,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「按住ZR键把手指按下去」
Dialogue: 0,2:25:36.81,2:25:38.42,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「松手手指就会抬回来」
Dialogue: 0,2:25:38.44,2:25:39.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,什么什么还写了什么
Dialogue: 0,2:25:41.24,2:25:44.06,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「接下来是抓住对手手指的练习」
Dialogue: 0,2:25:46.81,2:25:47.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:25:48.36,2:25:52.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,顺便一说，我拇指相扑超级强
Dialogue: 0,2:25:56.84,2:26:00.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,在迄今为止的人生中没有输过
Dialogue: 0,2:26:03.94,2:26:06.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过因为玩的次数很少
Dialogue: 0,2:26:06.62,2:26:08.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,只是小不点原露露的经历
Dialogue: 0,2:26:09.47,2:26:14.50,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「这次是被对方抓住时甩开手指的练习」
Dialogue: 0,2:26:24.88,2:26:26.19,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不会让你抓住的
Dialogue: 0,2:26:27.22,2:26:29.17,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「感觉绝对不会放开呢」
Dialogue: 0,2:26:29.27,2:26:30.29,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,绝……！
Dialogue: 0,2:26:31.50,2:26:32.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,…对不放开！
Dialogue: 0,2:26:33.68,2:26:35.05,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「这样基础就OK了」
Dialogue: 0,2:26:35.07,2:26:37.56,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「最后说一个特别规则」
Dialogue: 0,2:26:38.09,2:26:42.66,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「把手指按住一段时间，手指就会变大，力量提升」
Dialogue: 0,2:26:42.96,2:26:43.97,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,什么？！
Dialogue: 0,2:26:44.05,2:26:46.92,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「手指比对手越大，K.O.的机会就越大」
Dialogue: 0,2:26:47.01,2:26:51.69,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「被抓住的一方在挣脱的时候会更难甩开」
Dialogue: 0,2:26:52.14,2:26:53.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,原来如此，我想升级
Dialogue: 0,2:26:59.52,2:27:00.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好大
Dialogue: 0,2:27:01.28,2:27:02.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,美甲也感觉超有
Dialogue: 0,2:27:03.81,2:27:05.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,宇宙感
Dialogue: 0,2:27:05.54,2:27:08.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,简直是最近流行的宇宙美甲嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:27:10.39,2:27:12.59,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我的手也太大了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:27:15.20,2:27:16.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,点赞
Dialogue: 0,2:27:21.86,2:27:24.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那……开始吧
Dialogue: 0,2:27:35.19,2:27:36.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,得手！
Dialogue: 0,2:27:43.90,2:27:44.80,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好机会！
Dialogue: 0,2:27:47.31,2:27:48.35,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不放开
Dialogue: 0,2:27:49.35,2:27:52.20,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,Break就是被甩开的意思？
Dialogue: 0,2:27:56.04,2:27:57.86,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,绝对不放开
Dialogue: 0,2:27:58.80,2:27:59.77,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:28:02.35,2:28:03.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,先拿下一分
Dialogue: 0,2:28:08.48,2:28:09.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,2:28:14.33,2:28:15.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，好可惜
Dialogue: 0,2:28:17.22,2:28:18.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,假动作啊
Dialogue: 0,2:28:21.09,2:28:22.42,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嗯，有两下子
Dialogue: 0,2:28:26.87,2:28:27.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那什么啊
Dialogue: 0,2:28:32.44,2:28:33.44,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,得手！
Dialogue: 0,2:28:36.46,2:28:37.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么Break的
Dialogue: 0,2:28:41.56,2:28:42.46,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,得手
Dialogue: 0,2:28:51.04,2:28:52.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拿下——
Dialogue: 0,2:28:59.63,2:29:00.96,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「让他Break吧w」
Dialogue: 0,2:29:00.99,2:29:02.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,挣脱是什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:29:02.93,2:29:05.06,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拇指相扑还有Break这种东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:29:06.78,2:29:08.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这要中场休息？
Dialogue: 0,2:29:37.67,2:29:39.79,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「不被抓住而胜利」
Dialogue: 0,2:29:45.72,2:29:50.88,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「积极地抓住K.O. 把对方的手指」
Dialogue: 0,2:29:53.51,2:29:55.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,说起来热身是什么
Dialogue: 0,2:29:56.38,2:29:58.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,都已经玩了一堆了
Dialogue: 0,2:29:59.01,2:30:02.15,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「休闲运动·螺旋桨飞机」
Dialogue: 0,2:30:02.47,2:30:03.52,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:30:04.13,2:30:06.27,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「在空中飞来飞去巡岛」
Dialogue: 0,2:30:06.38,2:30:08.35,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,SPOCCO Photo……
Dialogue: 0,2:30:08.52,2:30:09.72,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,SPOCCO照片？
Dialogue: 0,2:30:09.77,2:30:11.80,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「多多收集吧」
Dialogue: 0,2:30:11.96,2:30:14.65,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「抢球比赛、自由模式」
Dialogue: 0,2:30:14.73,2:30:16.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这个好像要两个人起
Dialogue: 0,2:30:17.74,2:30:20.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,总之我先飞一下试试
Dialogue: 0,2:30:22.23,2:30:23.13,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,白天
Dialogue: 0,2:30:25.39,2:30:29.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,呃，先这样拿着，用一支玩
Dialogue: 0,2:30:32.70,2:30:34.22,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就是这样吧
Dialogue: 0,2:30:35.07,2:30:38.30,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「摘下腕带握着玩吧」
Dialogue: 0,2:30:35.07,2:30:38.30,GAMETEXT,,0,0,0,,{\pos(780,940)\fs56}戴上
Dialogue: 0,2:30:38.43,2:30:42.92,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「欢迎来到螺旋桨飞机，开始前先说明玩法」
Dialogue: 0,2:30:43.38,2:30:46.37,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「请把Joy-Con当成飞机来操作」
Dialogue: 0,2:30:46.59,2:30:49.44,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「用拇指和食指这样夹住拿」
Dialogue: 0,2:30:49.89,2:30:53.35,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「左右倾斜Joy-Con，飞机就会左右转弯」
Dialogue: 0,2:30:53.57,2:30:57.14,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「上下倾斜Joy-Con，飞机就会上下移动」
Dialogue: 0,2:30:57.24,2:30:58.50,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「说明结束」
Dialogue: 0,2:30:58.62,2:30:59.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:30:59.87,2:31:01.93,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「朝向画面保持水平」
Dialogue: 0,2:31:03.67,2:31:06.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是这样呀——喔——
Dialogue: 0,2:31:08.38,2:31:09.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,急下降
Dialogue: 0,2:31:10.18,2:31:11.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,急上升
Dialogue: 0,2:31:11.80,2:31:13.01,RURU,,0,0,0,,急下降
Dialogue: 0,2:31:20.70,2:31:22.78,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哇姑且命还在
Dialogue: 0,2:31:23.12,2:31:24.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶有点好玩
Dialogue: 0,2:31:24.83,2:31:26.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,急旋回
Dialogue: 0,2:31:31.80,2:31:32.59,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,2:31:35.77,2:31:38.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,减速是？这边是减速吗
Dialogue: 0,2:31:39.34,2:31:40.62,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,上升
Dialogue: 0,2:31:42.01,2:31:43.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,气球弹是什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:31:52.55,2:31:57.46,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这么拿着的话，气球弹意外地难打啊
Dialogue: 0,2:32:03.16,2:32:04.56,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好爽～
Dialogue: 0,2:32:05.64,2:32:06.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，试试看
Dialogue: 0,2:32:08.49,2:32:10.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那个打出去的东西，是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,2:32:14.75,2:32:18.34,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，出发，我稍微飞一下去
Dialogue: 0,2:32:19.66,2:32:23.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,「找相机收集拍照点吧」
Dialogue: 0,2:32:28.59,2:32:29.66,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是那个吗
Dialogue: 0,2:32:31.22,2:32:33.96,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「靠近岛屿名胜就会出现相机」
Dialogue: 0,2:32:34.13,2:32:37.34,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「碰到相机就能获得SPOCCO照片」
Dialogue: 0,2:32:37.44,2:32:40.63,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「在时间内巡游岛屿收集SPOCCO照片吧」
Dialogue: 0,2:32:40.76,2:32:41.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,2:32:44.71,2:32:46.62,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哦？风景不错
Dialogue: 0,2:32:47.43,2:32:48.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,Welcome Port
Dialogue: 0,2:32:49.22,2:32:50.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,Welcome to
Dialogue: 0,2:32:51.85,2:32:52.79,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,Ports
Dialogue: 0,2:32:57.11,2:32:58.22,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不错
Dialogue: 0,2:32:59.37,2:33:00.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还不错吧
Dialogue: 0,2:33:00.84,2:33:02.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,危险！
Dialogue: 0,2:33:04.03,2:33:05.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,玩砸了
Dialogue: 0,2:33:05.60,2:33:08.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,低空飞行意外的危险
Dialogue: 0,2:33:10.53,2:33:12.49,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过真是个好地方啊
Dialogue: 0,2:33:12.71,2:33:16.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有点度假胜地的感觉
Dialogue: 0,2:33:17.77,2:33:23.84,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「去本岛有走涟漪桥的陆路和坐联络船渡海的海路这两种」
Dialogue: 0,2:33:23.95,2:33:26.42,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,涟漪桥是这个吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:33:29.99,2:33:32.06,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等再来再来再来……还……
Dialogue: 0,2:33:32.28,2:33:33.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还没习惯
Dialogue: 0,2:33:33.10,2:33:34.40,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,身体对飞机的…
Dialogue: 0,2:33:34.98,2:33:37.66,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拍照点找到～～
Dialogue: 0,2:33:38.61,2:33:40.56,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,2:33:40.59,2:33:42.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,倾斜太多的话…
Dialogue: 0,2:33:43.87,2:33:46.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好像容易出事故啊…
Dialogue: 0,2:33:46.77,2:33:49.67,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「这是连接本岛和外围岛的唯一桥梁」
Dialogue: 0,2:33:49.84,2:33:50.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,右边
Dialogue: 0,2:33:51.18,2:33:52.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大家想去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,2:33:53.33,2:33:56.20,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我开飞机带你们去呀
Dialogue: 0,2:33:57.28,2:33:59.41,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这里我有点在意
Dialogue: 0,2:34:00.43,2:34:02.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,明明问了大家想去哪
Dialogue: 0,2:34:02.61,2:34:04.63,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,结果还是去了自己想去的地方
Dialogue: 0,2:34:05.48,2:34:07.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那个是乒乓球吧
Dialogue: 0,2:34:07.52,2:34:09.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好像有人在打乒乓球
Dialogue: 0,2:34:09.19,2:34:10.85,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「虽然是室外乒乓球场」
Dialogue: 0,2:34:10.87,2:34:14.96,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「但凭借先进技术实现了零风力影响」
Dialogue: 0,2:34:14.35,2:34:15.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶，好厉害
Dialogue: 0,2:34:16.06,2:34:17.39,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,风的影响……
Dialogue: 0,2:34:17.53,2:34:22.19,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,话说回来，乒乓球真的那么受风影响吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:34:22.73,2:34:26.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就感觉嘛，羽毛球啦网球啦那种
Dialogue: 0,2:34:27.51,2:34:29.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,带羽毛的才……
Dialogue: 0,2:34:30.63,2:34:34.38,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好像会受风影响来着，其实意外的不只是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,2:34:35.34,2:34:37.28,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不行，这个太有意思了……
Dialogue: 0,2:34:38.26,2:34:39.41,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好好玩
Dialogue: 0,2:34:42.57,2:34:44.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哦，好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:34:44.76,2:34:45.94,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，拍照点
Dialogue: 0,2:34:46.80,2:34:48.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有个像钟一样的东西
Dialogue: 0,2:34:49.62,2:34:50.36,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这个……
Dialogue: 0,2:34:51.01,2:34:53.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,敲一下难度不会暴涨吧
Dialogue: 0,2:34:52.31,2:34:56.58,GAMETEXT,,0,0,0,,「祝福之钟 敲响它做出永恒之爱的誓言」
Dialogue: 0,2:34:55.99,2:34:57.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，爱吗…
Dialogue: 0,2:34:56.63,2:34:59.22,GAMETEXT,,0,0,0,,「那口钟，您想向谁敲响呢？」
Dialogue: 0,2:34:59.54,2:35:00.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,向你吧
Dialogue: 0,2:35:03.22,2:35:04.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,排球场……
Dialogue: 0,2:35:10.05,2:35:12.40,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,说起来，那边那个心形不是挺有意思吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:35:12.53,2:35:14.44,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那个……有点难操作
Dialogue: 0,2:35:14.79,2:35:16.13,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,刚刚一瞬间……
Dialogue: 0,2:35:17.21,2:35:18.33,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,下面
Dialogue: 0,2:35:20.36,2:35:22.20,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有个拍照点
Dialogue: 0,2:35:24.68,2:35:28.00,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哇，感觉不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:35:30.38,2:35:32.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,从飞机上看
Dialogue: 0,2:35:33.21,2:35:35.36,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,靠海边那边
Dialogue: 0,2:35:35.41,2:35:39.06,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,果然很不错呢，降落前一刻的
Dialogue: 0,2:35:40.65,2:35:42.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,海附近的那种
Dialogue: 0,2:35:41.15,2:35:45.20,GAMETEXT,,0,0,0,,「心型岩 海中不知为何形成成心型的岩石」
Dialogue: 0,2:35:42.42,2:35:43.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,心形岩…
Dialogue: 0,2:35:44.42,2:35:45.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,安杰罗岩…
Dialogue: 0,2:35:45.28,2:35:48.54,GAMETEXT,,0,0,0,,「就算用气球弹击中也不会成就爱情」
Dialogue: 0,2:35:49.03,2:35:51.36,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这样啊，原来不会成就爱情，这样
Dialogue: 0,2:35:52.42,2:35:53.67,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,物理上
Dialogue: 0,2:35:55.95,2:35:57.90,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶话说这里好像有什么可以打的
Dialogue: 0,2:35:58.47,2:35:59.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,打不了吗…
Dialogue: 0,2:36:00.30,2:36:01.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，有什么东西
Dialogue: 0,2:36:01.79,2:36:03.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好像有鲨鱼呢
Dialogue: 0,2:36:04.36,2:36:07.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过说真的，对怕水的人来说这个不会很吓人吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:36:08.41,2:36:09.77,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不会吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:36:18.22,2:36:19.15,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,打中了！
Dialogue: 0,2:36:19.50,2:36:20.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,漂亮——
Dialogue: 0,2:36:21.94,2:36:24.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,稍微试了一下，打中了打中了
Dialogue: 0,2:36:24.28,2:36:26.94,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就是为了这个吗，气球弹
Dialogue: 0,2:36:31.99,2:36:35.58,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉心情上变成来观光的一样
Dialogue: 0,2:36:38.90,2:36:41.42,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「掉下去就是落海感觉好可怕」
Dialogue: 0,2:36:41.93,2:36:45.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嘛，实际上确实有点…
Dialogue: 0,2:36:45.93,2:36:49.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,毕竟挺深的，感觉还是很可怕的
Dialogue: 0,2:36:52.35,2:36:55.41,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,旋回啦～能行吗——
Dialogue: 0,2:36:58.11,2:36:59.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，成了
Dialogue: 0,2:37:00.62,2:37:04.69,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「岛上所有能源都由海上风车提供」
Dialogue: 0,2:37:04.94,2:37:07.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,海上风力发电场…
Dialogue: 0,2:37:08.04,2:37:09.91,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这座山也是
Dialogue: 0,2:37:10.14,2:37:12.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,绝对是拍照点吧
Dialogue: 0,2:37:13.61,2:37:17.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊——有个像洞窟的东西，但果然还是有点可怕
Dialogue: 0,2:37:17.87,2:37:19.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大概不会去…
Dialogue: 0,2:37:20.52,2:37:22.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,打退堂鼓了…
Dialogue: 0,2:37:23.49,2:37:25.22,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有点迪士尼…
Dialogue: 0,2:37:25.35,2:37:26.60,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，说出口了
Dialogue: 0,2:37:26.70,2:37:29.79,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,迪、迪◯尼◯◯之类的地方
Dialogue: 0,2:37:29.91,2:37:31.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不是有这种山吗
Dialogue: 0,2:37:34.40,2:37:35.65,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,长成这样的……
Dialogue: 0,2:37:37.63,2:37:40.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没出事故的平安旅途呢
Dialogue: 0,2:37:42.96,2:37:44.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,怎么样，拍得还挺多的吧
Dialogue: 0,2:37:45.01,2:37:48.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好厉害，能看到自己飞过的路线
Dialogue: 0,2:37:50.31,2:37:53.29,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,先直直往前，再往左一拐
Dialogue: 0,2:37:53.36,2:37:59.24,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,去了海上之后又回到岛这边，就是这样的巡游路线呢
Dialogue: 0,2:38:04.97,2:38:07.94,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哎，我开得还挺好的吧
Dialogue: 0,2:38:08.49,2:38:11.22,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「螺旋桨飞机新手衣服」
Dialogue: 0,2:38:15.02,2:38:16.22,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:38:16.88,2:38:19.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,话说岛好大啊
Dialogue: 0,2:38:20.33,2:38:22.77,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,HPO……不是HPO点……
Dialogue: 0,2:38:23.49,2:38:25.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拍照点、SPOCCO照片
Dialogue: 0,2:38:25.90,2:38:28.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,SPOCCO照片这词有点拗口呢
Dialogue: 0,2:38:31.22,2:38:34.85,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「加速和减速，快速向前推就是加速」
Dialogue: 0,2:38:35.33,2:38:37.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,原来是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,2:38:37.39,2:38:40.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,咻一下它就会加速
Dialogue: 0,2:38:40.67,2:38:44.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,收集球、捡起来夺过来，这个也有点
Dialogue: 0,2:38:44.22,2:38:45.40,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，是双人游玩的
Dialogue: 0,2:38:53.28,2:38:54.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:38:54.92,2:38:56.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,算了，去滑板吧
Dialogue: 0,2:38:57.86,2:38:59.52,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「岛屿名胜巡礼」
Dialogue: 0,2:38:59.62,2:39:01.82,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「在陆地上跑着环岛」
Dialogue: 0,2:39:02.02,2:39:03.76,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「多多收集SPOCCO照片吧」
Dialogue: 0,2:39:03.79,2:39:05.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这个也是SPOCCO
Dialogue: 0,2:39:05.25,2:39:06.58,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这个可以一个人玩
Dialogue: 0,2:39:06.74,2:39:08.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这个也可以一个人玩，好
Dialogue: 0,2:39:12.21,2:39:13.88,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「绿色街道」
Dialogue: 0,2:39:16.97,2:39:19.58,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,稍等，原来如此，是这种的
Dialogue: 0,2:39:19.67,2:39:20.67,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,2:39:22.05,2:39:24.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,刚刚把设备放到这了……
Dialogue: 0,2:39:24.07,2:39:25.33,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,2:39:36.77,2:39:37.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,能行吗
Dialogue: 0,2:39:37.89,2:39:41.78,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,空间意外地有点窄来着
Dialogue: 0,2:39:42.53,2:39:43.95,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,鼠标操作
Dialogue: 0,2:39:46.55,2:39:47.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:39:48.95,2:39:50.23,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,能行吗
Dialogue: 0,2:39:53.05,2:39:55.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,fa、fa、发板？
Dialogue: 0,2:39:55.32,2:39:56.92,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「欢迎来到滑板！」
Dialogue: 0,2:39:56.94,2:39:59.38,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「开始前先说明玩法」
Dialogue: 0,2:40:00.50,2:40:04.98,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「Joy-Con 2的握法，在平坦的地方像鼠标一样握着」
Dialogue: 0,2:40:06.49,2:40:10.63,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「向后滑动就会蹬地向前进」
Dialogue: 0,2:40:10.97,2:40:14.01,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「倾斜就会身体倾斜转弯」
Dialogue: 0,2:40:14.08,2:40:17.90,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「跑的时候按ZR会刹车减速」
Dialogue: 0,2:40:18.40,2:40:21.90,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「跑的时候快速上抬就会跳起来」
Dialogue: 0,2:40:21.98,2:40:24.21,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「小台阶的话能跳过去」
Dialogue: 0,2:40:24.43,2:40:25.59,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「说明就到这里」
Dialogue: 0,2:40:25.61,2:40:27.82,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「接下来练习操作吧」
Dialogue: 0,2:40:27.95,2:40:29.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,2:40:29.79,2:40:32.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,放平了，试运行
Dialogue: 0,2:40:36.33,2:40:37.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊…啊！
Dialogue: 0,2:40:37.35,2:40:38.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好好玩！
Dialogue: 0,2:40:42.39,2:40:43.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还要更多更多加速
Dialogue: 0,2:40:47.11,2:40:47.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,糟了糟了
Dialogue: 0,2:40:54.71,2:40:55.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,跳跃
Dialogue: 0,2:40:58.04,2:40:59.35,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,加速
Dialogue: 0,2:41:04.40,2:41:06.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,撞到的话好像挺危险的
Dialogue: 0,2:41:10.17,2:41:11.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,2:41:13.48,2:41:15.33,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哦——OKOK
Dialogue: 0,2:41:15.56,2:41:17.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,操作意外地还挺简单的嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:41:18.92,2:41:20.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rChat}「像柯南君似的」{\r}确实
Dialogue: 0,2:41:25.90,2:41:27.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,滑板还挺可爱的
Dialogue: 0,2:41:27.66,2:41:30.56,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「找相机收集SPOCCO照片吧」
Dialogue: 0,2:41:32.91,2:41:34.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，上了
Dialogue: 0,2:41:39.88,2:41:42.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,意外地绿色的地方
Dialogue: 0,2:41:42.64,2:41:44.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉挺难跑的
Dialogue: 0,2:41:44.89,2:41:48.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过滑板我好像没玩过呢
Dialogue: 0,2:41:48.50,2:41:50.40,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,轮滑倒是玩过
Dialogue: 0,2:41:48.50,2:41:54.91,GAMETEXT,,0,0,0,,「绿街 对于滑板来说是个绝佳的练习场所，坡道会一直持续」
Dialogue: 0,2:41:54.28,2:41:55.36,RURU,,0,0,0,,还真是
Dialogue: 0,2:41:59.49,2:42:00.72,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拿到
Dialogue: 0,2:42:12.44,2:42:13.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不会摔倒吗
Dialogue: 0,2:42:13.94,2:42:16.70,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,对玩滑板的人来说这地方很赞啊
Dialogue: 0,2:42:16.72,2:42:18.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，找到
Dialogue: 0,2:42:21.14,2:42:23.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这种地方是挺想去的
Dialogue: 0,2:42:21.14,2:42:25.69,GAMETEXT,,0,0,0,,「奥利山 对于野餐是个绝佳场所」
Dialogue: 0,2:42:23.57,2:42:24.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,目前先
Dialogue: 0,2:42:24.90,2:42:27.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还是先去拍照点吧
Dialogue: 0,2:42:27.23,2:42:28.39,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,奥利山
Dialogue: 0,2:42:28.68,2:42:32.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,确实，在这野餐感觉超棒啊
Dialogue: 0,2:42:33.28,2:42:34.72,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,看着就舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:42:36.69,2:42:38.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,时机有点晚了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:42:39.17,2:42:43.33,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过，这种…绿意盎然的地方
Dialogue: 0,2:42:43.36,2:42:44.81,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还挺想去的啊…
Dialogue: 0,2:42:45.29,2:42:47.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，拍照点
Dialogue: 0,2:42:47.16,2:42:48.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,绝对跑反了
Dialogue: 0,2:42:50.14,2:42:52.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉好像逆行了
Dialogue: 0,2:42:52.55,2:42:53.75,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这边能过去吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:42:53.77,2:42:54.78,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,痛痛痛…
Dialogue: 0,2:42:56.94,2:42:59.70,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过跟飞机不一样，这个…
Dialogue: 0,2:43:00.79,2:43:01.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没有那个吧
Dialogue: 0,2:43:01.62,2:43:02.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,转向
Dialogue: 0,2:43:02.94,2:43:04.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,等一下，我想转个方向
Dialogue: 0,2:43:05.92,2:43:07.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，是这么回事啊…
Dialogue: 0,2:43:08.34,2:43:10.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我就是觉得这上面是不是有什么东西
Dialogue: 0,2:43:15.53,2:43:17.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不会有生命危险吧
Dialogue: 0,2:43:22.30,2:43:23.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,2:43:24.58,2:43:27.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,时间损失的有点……
Dialogue: 0,2:43:34.98,2:43:36.11,RURU,,0,0,0,,无价之宝
Dialogue: 0,2:43:39.75,2:43:42.57,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哇，真不错啊大自然
Dialogue: 0,2:43:44.21,2:43:48.66,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,滑板……滑冰什么的倒是玩过
Dialogue: 0,2:43:49.06,2:43:51.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,意外地挺难的吧
Dialogue: 0,2:43:51.42,2:43:53.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,滑板车之类的那种样子？
Dialogue: 0,2:43:54.68,2:43:57.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好久以前我也有过滑板车来着
Dialogue: 0,2:43:57.31,2:43:58.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这又是什～么
Dialogue: 0,2:44:05.68,2:44:08.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这地方也太好了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:44:09.01,2:44:10.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有海
Dialogue: 0,2:44:12.49,2:44:13.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,也有绿植
Dialogue: 0,2:44:20.90,2:44:23.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这种像硬币一样的
Dialogue: 0,2:44:24.93,2:44:26.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不怎么需要特地收集吗
Dialogue: 0,2:44:28.56,2:44:30.56,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拍照点～～
Dialogue: 0,2:44:31.26,2:44:33.33,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,该不会就是刚才那个……
Dialogue: 0,2:44:33.76,2:44:35.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这什么车啊
Dialogue: 0,2:44:35.63,2:44:37.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,之前说过进洞窟
Dialogue: 0,2:44:37.96,2:44:41.13,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,坐飞机进去很可怕什么的
Dialogue: 0,2:44:41.68,2:44:43.40,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,说不定这个
Dialogue: 0,2:44:44.01,2:44:45.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,可以靠这个进去呢
Dialogue: 0,2:44:46.72,2:44:47.96,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:44:49.42,2:44:51.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,露天保龄球
Dialogue: 0,2:44:51.84,2:44:53.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶？蓝天白云下的保龄球？
Dialogue: 0,2:44:53.96,2:44:56.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我之前玩的地方该不会就是这里吧
Dialogue: 0,2:45:02.17,2:45:04.40,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,原来是这个样子的…
Dialogue: 0,2:45:05.33,2:45:07.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，撞飞了，失礼了
Dialogue: 0,2:45:09.82,2:45:11.87,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「洞窟也是坐飞机去的哦」
Dialogue: 0,2:45:11.92,2:45:13.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，也是飞机啊…
Dialogue: 0,2:45:14.41,2:45:16.12,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我还在想
Dialogue: 0,2:45:16.49,2:45:18.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是不是用滑板进去呢
Dialogue: 0,2:45:24.07,2:45:27.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,车倒也有车的乐趣啊
Dialogue: 0,2:45:27.25,2:45:28.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,车？
Dialogue: 0,2:45:30.55,2:45:31.65,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是车吧
Dialogue: 0,2:45:31.73,2:45:32.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,2:45:33.81,2:45:35.59,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,作为车来说
Dialogue: 0,2:45:40.72,2:45:43.58,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉像侏罗纪公园里会出来的……
Dialogue: 0,2:45:43.79,2:45:46.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这种轨道，这轨道是什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:45:46.85,2:45:48.18,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,难道能上去？
Dialogue: 0,2:45:50.22,2:45:51.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,2:45:54.18,2:45:55.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,乘上了～
Dialogue: 0,2:45:55.71,2:45:56.67,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,2:46:04.07,2:46:05.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,能乘上去啊
Dialogue: 0,2:46:06.36,2:46:07.63,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好帅～
Dialogue: 0,2:46:10.17,2:46:13.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过受伤了的话，意外地也挺危险的
Dialogue: 0,2:46:15.01,2:46:17.15,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,急转弯好像有点难
Dialogue: 0,2:46:22.02,2:46:25.39,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过不管什么移动工具急转弯都挺难的
Dialogue: 0,2:46:25.45,2:46:26.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,实际上也挺危险的……
Dialogue: 0,2:46:29.15,2:46:30.67,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过也是呢
Dialogue: 0,2:46:32.91,2:46:35.77,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,独眼巨人的爪子
Dialogue: 0,2:46:39.63,2:46:40.88,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,Finish
Dialogue: 0,2:46:45.34,2:46:49.40,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,意外的没拍多少吗…不对，意外的跑了很多地方啊
Dialogue: 0,2:46:49.80,2:46:53.08,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,跟飞机那时候比是少了点…
Dialogue: 0,2:46:57.73,2:46:58.87,RURU,,0,0,0,,独眼巨……
Dialogue: 0,2:46:59.31,2:47:02.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,独眼巨人总觉得是那种硬邦邦的
Dialogue: 0,2:47:03.75,2:47:06.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,有点像妖怪的感觉
Dialogue: 0,2:47:08.85,2:47:11.96,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我已经分不清哪个是鼠标、哪个是那个了
Dialogue: 0,2:47:15.53,2:47:18.46,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,意外地找到了7个拍照点
Dialogue: 0,2:47:18.88,2:47:19.42,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,2:47:19.79,2:47:23.59,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那跟飞机比起来……也没差很多啊
Dialogue: 0,2:47:23.75,2:47:24.65,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,飞行距离
Dialogue: 0,2:47:26.73,2:47:28.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,意外地还行嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:47:29.72,2:47:31.47,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「拖动的强度」
Dialogue: 0,2:47:32.27,2:47:36.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就是说其实速度拉的还挺快的
Dialogue: 0,2:47:36.64,2:47:38.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,水上运动……？
Dialogue: 0,2:47:39.99,2:47:42.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，这是最后一个了
Dialogue: 0,2:47:42.23,2:47:44.47,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「休闲运动·水上摩托」
Dialogue: 0,2:47:44.79,2:47:48.42,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,水上运动什么的都还没玩过呢，不过说起来
Dialogue: 0,2:47:48.67,2:47:51.42,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,冬季运动那些也差不多没怎么玩过
Dialogue: 0,2:47:52.35,2:47:56.81,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过接下来正好是玩冬季运动的季节吧
Dialogue: 0,2:47:58.35,2:47:59.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,冬天的话
Dialogue: 0,2:48:01.19,2:48:02.17,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,滑雪
Dialogue: 0,2:48:02.85,2:48:04.38,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,单板滑雪
Dialogue: 0,2:48:04.62,2:48:06.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,滑冰……
Dialogue: 0,2:48:07.15,2:48:09.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉像魔法气泡的连锁一样……
Dialogue: 0,2:48:09.35,2:48:12.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,滑雪、单板滑雪、滑冰
Dialogue: 0,2:48:12.09,2:48:13.30,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,Diacute！
Dialogue: 0,2:48:14.20,2:48:15.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,Bayoen～
Dialogue: 0,2:48:15.30,2:48:16.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,Bayoen～
Dialogue: 0,2:48:16.47,2:48:17.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,寿限无
Dialogue: 0,2:48:19.56,2:48:20.74,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「单板滑雪什么的会玩吗」
Dialogue: 0,2:48:20.76,2:48:23.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不行吧，没玩过
Dialogue: 0,2:48:30.50,2:48:33.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，啊这个要用两个，等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,2:48:33.09,2:48:34.26,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这样，这样就行
Dialogue: 0,2:48:34.94,2:48:39.17,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「点赞握法就是竖起大拇指握住Joy-Con」
Dialogue: 0,2:48:40.76,2:48:41.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,2:48:46.48,2:48:48.15,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,滑雪的话我玩过哦
Dialogue: 0,2:48:48.24,2:48:49.15,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,滑雪的话
Dialogue: 0,2:48:49.50,2:48:51.04,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「欢迎来到水上摩托！」
Dialogue: 0,2:48:51.13,2:48:53.49,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「开始前先说明玩法」
Dialogue: 0,2:48:53.98,2:48:57.90,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「竖起大拇指握住Joy-Con，然后向侧面倾倒」
Dialogue: 0,2:48:57.93,2:48:59.62,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，原来如此
Dialogue: 0,2:48:59.95,2:49:01.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这个就是把手
Dialogue: 0,2:49:02.51,2:49:04.17,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,摩托，好像挺好玩的嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:49:04.52,2:49:09.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rGame}「水上摩托的操作方法，ZL或者」{\r}……
Dialogue: 0,2:49:09.58,2:49:10.45,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,完了
Dialogue: 0,2:49:12.62,2:49:14.15,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好像跳过了
Dialogue: 0,2:49:15.65,2:49:18.76,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「横过来用拇指按按钮」
Dialogue: 0,2:49:21.48,2:49:22.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就是这样吧
Dialogue: 0,2:49:28.49,2:49:30.19,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,刹车什么的，怎么弄啊…
Dialogue: 0,2:49:40.85,2:49:44.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,绝……对！超爽的，好想骑…
Dialogue: 0,2:49:45.41,2:49:46.95,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好想实际
Dialogue: 0,2:49:47.77,2:49:50.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,体验一下这种呢…
Dialogue: 0,2:50:04.48,2:50:05.60,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，OKOK
Dialogue: 0,2:50:05.63,2:50:07.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,没有刹车呢，OK
Dialogue: 0,2:50:12.93,2:50:13.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:50:15.61,2:50:16.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,2:50:18.15,2:50:19.87,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「岛屿名胜巡礼」
Dialogue: 0,2:50:20.66,2:50:22.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,出发
Dialogue: 0,2:50:24.17,2:50:25.98,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大家放心哦
Dialogue: 0,2:50:26.21,2:50:28.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我会无事故跑完的
Dialogue: 0,2:50:29.26,2:50:33.02,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,水上运动也是，出了事故会很危险吧
Dialogue: 0,2:50:34.04,2:50:35.65,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嘛，什么都很危险啦…
Dialogue: 0,2:50:41.39,2:50:42.96,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这个不会撞到吗
Dialogue: 0,2:50:48.25,2:50:49.79,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,虽说没刹车
Dialogue: 0,2:50:50.22,2:50:52.03,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过靠操控总能搞定
Dialogue: 0,2:50:55.08,2:50:57.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,入口港
Dialogue: 0,2:51:01.17,2:51:04.38,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那边那个桥的地方绝对
Dialogue: 0,2:51:05.09,2:51:06.57,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是个拍照点
Dialogue: 0,2:51:07.64,2:51:10.03,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「其实水是挺『硬』的」
Dialogue: 0,2:51:11.42,2:51:12.98,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,原来还挺危险的啊
Dialogue: 0,2:51:14.27,2:51:15.66,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「速度一快的话」
Dialogue: 0,2:51:15.72,2:51:18.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哦？有金色的游泳圈
Dialogue: 0,2:51:20.16,2:51:21.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，拿到手了
Dialogue: 0,2:51:40.65,2:51:43.76,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「要动脊柱」「就像混凝土一样」
Dialogue: 0,2:51:44.29,2:51:46.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不，确实听说过
Dialogue: 0,2:51:46.64,2:51:49.38,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,说是从特别高的地方砸下来的话
Dialogue: 0,2:51:49.82,2:51:52.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,结果就像混凝土一样硬
Dialogue: 0,2:51:53.78,2:51:54.98,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,说超痛的
Dialogue: 0,2:51:56.94,2:52:00.28,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还挺痛的来着，水这东西
Dialogue: 0,2:52:07.13,2:52:08.85,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊有波浪……
Dialogue: 0,2:52:20.77,2:52:22.87,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，不过怎么说，好真实啊……
Dialogue: 0,2:52:23.23,2:52:24.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,声音什么的
Dialogue: 0,2:52:25.12,2:52:26.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,说是红门大桥
Dialogue: 0,2:52:26.81,2:52:28.15,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哇是波浪——
Dialogue: 0,2:52:29.12,2:52:30.31,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,哇，飞起来了——
Dialogue: 0,2:52:31.04,2:52:32.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不妙，太爽了
Dialogue: 0,2:52:42.71,2:52:44.15,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,去哪好呢
Dialogue: 0,2:52:45.12,2:52:46.86,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶波浪很不错诶
Dialogue: 0,2:52:52.13,2:52:53.46,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「拧一下涡轮加速」
Dialogue: 0,2:52:54.66,2:52:56.78,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,原来拧一下就能加速啊
Dialogue: 0,2:53:01.02,2:53:02.42,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拧着涡轮加速
Dialogue: 0,2:53:02.59,2:53:05.10,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这样啊，原来是这样
Dialogue: 0,2:53:10.36,2:53:12.36,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉那边也有点什么
Dialogue: 0,2:53:16.39,2:53:18.96,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拍照点意外的少
Dialogue: 0,2:53:21.78,2:53:23.02,RURU,,0,0,0,,1/5
Dialogue: 0,2:53:29.89,2:53:32.44,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这里不是拍照点吗
Dialogue: 0,2:53:35.95,2:53:38.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这个……要穿过去之类的吗
Dialogue: 0,2:53:41.24,2:53:44.39,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「是在模仿真实的把手操作吗？」
Dialogue: 0,2:53:44.52,2:53:46.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,2:53:46.75,2:53:48.95,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过说不定还真是这样
Dialogue: 0,2:53:50.40,2:53:54.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,虽说我没真的开过所以不知道
Dialogue: 0,2:54:04.14,2:54:08.97,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过这动作什么的还挺真实的……
Dialogue: 0,2:54:11.79,2:54:16.17,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就像水花飞溅、弹回来的感觉什么的……
Dialogue: 0,2:54:18.27,2:54:20.39,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,说是游泳圈收集了20个
Dialogue: 0,2:54:22.98,2:54:24.60,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这里也有吧
Dialogue: 0,2:54:24.62,2:54:25.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这三个
Dialogue: 0,2:54:26.50,2:54:28.06,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,米开朗基罗岩……
Dialogue: 0,2:54:28.65,2:54:29.98,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,之类的东西
Dialogue: 0,2:54:32.42,2:54:34.11,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,果然！有了～
Dialogue: 0,2:54:38.37,2:54:39.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拍得到吗
Dialogue: 0,2:54:44.41,2:54:45.25,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊……
Dialogue: 0,2:54:56.47,2:54:58.42,GAMETEXT,,0,0,0,,「怒涛的达伊查布岩」
Dialogue: 0,2:54:58.44,2:55:02.83,GAMETEXT,,0,0,0,,「传说中被破坏与再生之神纳曼加打飞的巨石群」
Dialogue: 0,2:54:57.75,2:54:59.35,RURU,,0,0,0,,好，拍到了
Dialogue: 0,2:55:02.60,2:55:05.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,纳纳纳、纳曼加是什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:55:06.31,2:55:09.19,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,纳曼加是什么？打飞又是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,2:55:14.14,2:55:19.01,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,像刚才那样，硬往海滨上冲的话
Dialogue: 0,2:55:19.57,2:55:21.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉超容易把摩托弄坏的
Dialogue: 0,2:55:22.04,2:55:25.00,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那个金色的，我想试着穿过去一次
Dialogue: 0,2:55:31.67,2:55:35.04,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊——就差一点没赶上
Dialogue: 0,2:55:36.69,2:55:40.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,到底跑了多远呢，感觉应该挺远的
Dialogue: 0,2:55:48.14,2:55:50.62,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,红门大桥
Dialogue: 0,2:55:51.31,2:55:52.94,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,差一点没够到
Dialogue: 0,2:55:59.39,2:56:00.68,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过推进不少
Dialogue: 0,2:56:00.70,2:56:03.07,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,说不定是最远的一次？
Dialogue: 0,2:56:03.20,2:56:05.97,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拍照点本身倒是没怎么逛到
Dialogue: 0,2:56:07.70,2:56:09.96,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过救生圈拿了好多
Dialogue: 0,2:56:09.98,2:56:11.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,诶，金色那个好厉害
Dialogue: 0,2:56:11.34,2:56:13.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,能拿50点数
Dialogue: 0,2:56:16.26,2:56:17.76,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「恭喜达成」
Dialogue: 0,2:56:17.78,2:56:21.70,GAMETEXT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「玩遍所有项目 彩虹铭牌」
Dialogue: 0,2:56:21.90,2:56:22.97,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,拿到啦
Dialogue: 0,2:56:28.24,2:56:30.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,姑且都玩了一圈这样
Dialogue: 0,2:56:36.13,2:56:37.74,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过真的超好玩
Dialogue: 0,2:56:37.76,2:56:38.62,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,话说
Dialogue: 0,2:56:39.38,2:56:41.81,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,这个的另一个
Dialogue: 0,2:56:41.84,2:56:43.82,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好像有个前作
Dialogue: 0,2:56:43.84,2:56:45.76,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,Wii……不对不是Wii……
Dialogue: 0,2:56:46.21,2:56:50.44,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,是Nintendo Switch Sports那样的
Dialogue: 0,2:56:51.54,2:56:53.41,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「哪个最好玩？」
Dialogue: 0,2:56:53.43,2:56:58.94,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,呃但…拳、拳击…射箭也挺不错的
Dialogue: 0,2:57:02.18,2:57:04.97,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过滑水也挺好玩的
Dialogue: 0,2:57:05.38,2:57:07.35,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,滑水…水上摩托
Dialogue: 0,2:57:07.52,2:57:09.28,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,和滑水好像不一样
Dialogue: 0,2:57:13.54,2:57:16.19,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「Wii上有的剑道没有，有点遗憾」
Dialogue: 0,2:57:16.21,2:57:19.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,啊，好像有类似剑道的东西
Dialogue: 0,2:57:20.77,2:57:22.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过内容还挺丰富的
Dialogue: 0,2:57:23.76,2:57:26.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rChat}「是Wii版吗」{\r}好像Wii上也有来着
Dialogue: 0,2:57:26.39,2:57:31.00,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好像有好几个呢，这什么运动类的……游戏
Dialogue: 0,2:57:33.03,2:57:36.19,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉在那之后更进一步进化了
Dialogue: 0,2:57:37.43,2:57:39.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,相当真实
Dialogue: 0,2:57:41.24,2:57:43.14,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「Wii的剑道真的很好玩」
Dialogue: 0,2:57:43.30,2:57:45.05,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,剑道是很好玩呢
Dialogue: 0,2:57:45.18,2:57:46.39,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,实际的……
Dialogue: 0,2:57:46.47,2:57:48.90,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,现实的剑道本身也挺好玩的w
Dialogue: 0,2:57:50.06,2:57:52.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,我小时候经常玩的啊——
Dialogue: 0,2:57:53.02,2:57:54.51,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,剑道过家家
Dialogue: 0,2:57:55.53,2:57:58.44,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,现在都不玩了呢
Dialogue: 0,2:57:59.62,2:58:01.83,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rChat}「感觉第二天会肌肉酸痛」{\r}是啊
Dialogue: 0,2:58:02.02,2:58:07.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,话说我其实现在就已经微微有点肌肉酸痛了
Dialogue: 0,2:58:10.12,2:58:12.17,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,而且明天说不定
Dialogue: 0,2:58:13.01,2:58:15.69,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,会因为拳击那个……不，我觉得应该不会就是了
Dialogue: 0,2:58:15.80,2:58:20.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,肌肉酸痛……因为用了平时不用的肌肉
Dialogue: 0,2:58:20.23,2:58:22.27,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就有一点点
Dialogue: 0,2:58:22.35,2:58:23.55,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,{\rChat}「没事吧…？」{\r}完全没w
Dialogue: 0,2:58:23.61,2:58:25.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,完全没问题的
Dialogue: 0,2:58:25.57,2:58:27.43,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,在决斗大师也一直在那挥来挥去的
Dialogue: 0,2:58:34.22,2:58:36.19,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,2:58:37.05,2:58:38.13,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那个，大家
Dialogue: 0,2:58:38.68,2:58:42.14,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,今天也感谢观看
Dialogue: 0,2:58:42.28,2:58:44.67,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,其实还想再玩一会儿来着
Dialogue: 0,2:58:44.70,2:58:48.21,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过刚才也说了嘛，到早上……
Dialogue: 0,2:58:48.63,2:58:49.93,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,还有些活
Dialogue: 0,2:58:50.16,2:58:52.96,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,太晚的话就会有点那个……
Dialogue: 0,2:58:53.07,2:58:56.06,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,说回来也不对，这是我自己不对就是了
Dialogue: 0,2:58:57.07,2:58:59.63,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,特别是昨天
Dialogue: 0,2:59:00.46,2:59:02.71,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,本来想着早点睡的
Dialogue: 0,2:59:04.68,2:59:09.42,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,因为睡前碰了决斗大师
Dialogue: 0,2:59:12.04,2:59:16.86,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,所以今天一定要好好睡
Dialogue: 0,2:59:17.03,2:59:18.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,今天一定让我好好睡一觉
Dialogue: 0,2:59:21.27,2:59:22.46,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,得注意点，真的
Dialogue: 0,2:59:22.48,2:59:26.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,而且睡前玩一小下对我来说是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,2:59:30.68,2:59:33.47,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,能不能上大师啊，大师段位
Dialogue: 0,2:59:33.68,2:59:35.54,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大师段位是不是很难上
Dialogue: 0,2:59:39.85,2:59:41.45,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「一瞬之差就可能致命」
Dialogue: 0,2:59:41.93,2:59:43.61,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,就感觉一直
Dialogue: 0,2:59:46.13,2:59:50.20,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不管赢还是输都会一直玩下去
Dialogue: 0,2:59:52.78,2:59:54.10,CHAT,Ruru,0,0,0,,「反正你今天也要玩w」
Dialogue: 0,2:59:54.13,2:59:55.66,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不不，想尽量不玩
Dialogue: 0,2:59:55.73,2:59:57.38,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不对，但可能会玩一次
Dialogue: 0,2:59:57.54,2:59:58.92,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不对，但再怎么说……
Dialogue: 0,2:59:59.20,3:00:01.89,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,再怎么说昨天也玩太多了……
Dialogue: 0,3:00:02.84,3:00:03.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,睡了
Dialogue: 0,3:00:04.73,3:00:05.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,要睡要睡
Dialogue: 0,3:00:06.27,3:00:07.64,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,会睡会睡，我会好好睡觉
Dialogue: 0,3:00:07.66,3:00:09.41,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,感觉再不好好睡就完了
Dialogue: 0,3:00:09.50,3:00:11.50,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,好，那么大家
Dialogue: 0,3:00:12.11,3:00:17.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,今天也感谢观看——
Dialogue: 0,3:00:18.24,3:00:20.37,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嗯，今天是很少见的
Dialogue: 0,3:00:20.49,3:00:24.66,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,用虹3D进行的直播，大家觉得怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,3:00:25.01,3:00:26.60,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,嘛，虽然
Dialogue: 0,3:00:27.29,3:00:30.48,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,平时也没什么场合去用
Dialogue: 0,3:00:30.81,3:00:31.84,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,不过偶尔嘛
Dialogue: 0,3:00:31.94,3:00:34.73,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,偶尔来一次也不错吧
Dialogue: 0,3:00:35.23,3:00:39.70,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那么今天也感谢大家的观看
Dialogue: 0,3:00:39.80,3:00:42.32,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那让我们下次再会～
Dialogue: 0,3:00:42.56,3:00:46.79,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,那么拜拜——拜拜——拜拜——
Dialogue: 0,3:00:49.42,3:00:51.29,RURU,,0,0,0,,拜拜——
Dialogue: 0,3:00:51.40,3:00:53.09,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,辛苦露露～
Dialogue: 0,3:00:53.14,3:00:56.99,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,大家游戏也要适可而止，记得睡觉哦
Dialogue: 0,3:00:59.19,3:01:01.16,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,别学我这样哦
Dialogue: 0,3:01:02.05,3:01:03.22,RURU,Ruru,0,0,0,,下次见～
